#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sprite2D is a Node2D, a CanvasItem and a Node. It has all the properties and "
"features of its three parent classes, like transforms or the ability to draw "
"custom shapes and render with a custom shader."
msgstr ""
"Sprite2D és un Node2D, un CanvasItem i un Node. Té totes les propietats i "
"característiques de les seves tres classes principals, com ara les "
"transformacions o la capacitat de dibuixar formes personalitzades i "
"renderitzar amb un ombrejat personalitzat."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:68
msgid "All-inclusive package"
msgstr "Paquet amb tot inclòs"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:70
msgid ""
"Godot tries to provide its own tools to answer most common needs. It has a "
"dedicated scripting workspace, an animation editor, a tilemap editor, a "
"shader editor, a debugger, a profiler, the ability to hot-reload locally and "
"on remote devices, etc."
msgstr ""
"Godot intenta oferir les seves pròpies eines per respondre a les necessitats "
"més habituals. Té un espai de treball de scripts dedicat, un editor "
"d'animacions, un editor de mapes de mosaic, un editor d'ombres, un "
"depurador, un perfilador, la possibilitat de recarregar en calent localment "
"i en dispositius remots, etc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:75
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:369
