msgstr ""
"Creeu una escena nova i afegiu un :ref:`Node <class_Node>` anomenat "
"``Main``. (La raó per la qual estem usant Node en lloc de Node2D és perquè "
"aquest node serà un contenidor per gestionar la lògica del joc. No requereix "
"la funcionalitat 2D en si.)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:12
msgid ""
"Click the **Instance** button (represented by a chain link icon) and select "
"your saved ``player.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic al botó **Instància** (representat per una icona d'enllaç de "
"cadena) i seleccioneu el vostre ``player.tscn`` desat."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:17
msgid ""
"Now, add the following nodes as children of ``Main``, and name them as shown:"
msgstr ""
"Ara, afegiu els nodes següents com a fills de ``Main`` i nomeneu-los com es "
"mostra:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:19
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``MobTimer``) - to control how often mobs "
"spawn"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (anomenat ``MobTimer``) - per controlar la "
"freqüència amb què es generen les turbes"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``ScoreTimer``) - to increment the score "
"every second"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (anomenat ``ScoreTimer``) - per augmentar la "
"puntuació cada segon"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``StartTimer``) - to give a delay before "
"starting"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (anomenat ``StartTimer``) - per donar un retard "
"abans de començar"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`Marker2D <class_Marker2D>` (named ``StartPosition``) - to indicate the "
"player's start position"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Marker2D <class_Marker2D>` (anomenat ``StartPosition``) - per indicar "
"la posició inicial del jugador"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:28
msgid ""
"Set the ``Wait Time`` property of each of the ``Timer`` nodes as follows "
"(values are in seconds):"
msgstr ""
"Establiu la propietat ``Wait Time`` de cadascun dels nodes ``Timer`` de la "
"manera següent (els valors són en segons):"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:30
msgid "``MobTimer``: ``0.5``"
msgstr "``MobTimer``: ``0,5``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:31
msgid "``ScoreTimer``: ``1``"
msgstr "``ScoreTimer``: ``1``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:32
msgid "``StartTimer``: ``2``"
msgstr "``StartTimer``: ``2``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:34
msgid ""
"In addition, set the ``One Shot`` property of ``StartTimer`` to \"On\" and "
"set ``Position`` of the ``StartPosition`` node to ``(240, 450)``."
msgstr ""
"A més, configureu la propietat ``One Shot`` de ``StartTimer`` a \"On\" i "
"configureu ``Position`` del node ``StartPosition`` a ``(240, 450)``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:38
msgid "Spawning mobs"
msgstr "Generant multituds"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:40
msgid ""
"The Main node will be spawning new mobs, and we want them to appear at a "
"random location on the edge of the screen. Click the ``Main`` node in the "
"Scene dock, then add a child :ref:`Path2D <class_Path2D>` node named "
"``MobPath``. When you select ``Path2D``, you will see some new buttons at "
"the top of the editor:"
msgstr ""
"El node principal generarà nous mobs i volem que apareguin en una ubicació "
"aleatòria a la vora de la pantalla. Feu clic al node ``Main`` al moll de "
"l'Escena i, a continuació, afegiu un node fill :ref:`Path2D <class_Path2D>` "
"anomenat ``MobPath``. Quan seleccioneu ``Path2D``, veureu alguns botons nous "
"a la part superior de l'editor:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select the middle one (\"Add Point\") and draw the path by clicking to add "
"the points at the corners shown. To have the points snap to the grid, make "
"sure \"Use Grid Snap\" and \"Use Smart Snap\" are both selected. These "
"options can be found to the left of the \"Lock\" button, appearing as a "
"magnet next to some dots and intersecting lines, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu el del mig (\"Afegeix punt\") i dibuixeu el camí fent clic per "
"afegir els punts a les cantonades mostrades. Perquè els punts s'ajustin a la "
"quadrícula, assegureu-vos que \"Utilitza Grid Snap\" i \"Use Smart Snap\" "
"estan tots dos seleccionats. Aquestes opcions es poden trobar a l'esquerra "
"del botó \"Bloquejar\", apareixent com un imant al costat d'alguns punts i "
"línies que s'intersequen, respectivament."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:55
msgid ""
"Draw the path in *clockwise* order, or your mobs will spawn pointing "
"*outwards* instead of *inwards*!"
msgstr ""
"Dibuixa el camí en ordre *en el sentit de les agulles del rellotge*, o els "
"teus mobs apareixeran apuntant *cap a fora* en lloc de *endins*!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:60
msgid ""
"After placing point ``4`` in the image, click the \"Close Curve\" button and "
"your curve will be complete."
msgstr ""
"Després de col·locar el punt ``4`` a la imatge, feu clic al botó \"Tanca la "
"corba\" i la vostra corba estarà completa."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:63
msgid ""
"Now that the path is defined, add a :ref:`PathFollow2D <class_PathFollow2D>` "
"node as a child of ``MobPath`` and name it ``MobSpawnLocation``. This node "
"will automatically rotate and follow the path as it moves, so we can use it "
"to select a random position and direction along the path."
msgstr ""
"Ara que el camí està definit, afegiu un node :ref:`PathFollow2D "
"<class_PathFollow2D>` com a fill de ``MobPath`` i anomeneu-lo "
"``MobSpawnLocation``. Aquest node girarà automàticament i seguirà el camí a "
"mesura que es mou, de manera que el podem utilitzar per seleccionar una "
"posició i una direcció aleatòries al llarg del camí."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:68
msgid "Your scene should look like this:"
msgstr "La teva escena hauria de ser així:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:73
