"que volem instància."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:101
msgid ""
"Click the ``Main`` node and you will see the ``Mob Scene`` property in the "
"Inspector under \"Main.gd\"."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic al node ``Main`` i veureu la propietat ``Mob Scene`` a l'Inspector "
"a \"Main.gd\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:104
msgid "You can assign this property's value in two ways:"
msgstr "Podeu assignar el valor d'aquesta propietat de dues maneres:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:106
msgid ""
"Drag ``mob.tscn`` from the \"FileSystem\" dock and drop it in the **Mob "
"Scene** property."
msgstr ""
"Arrossegueu ``mob.tscn`` des del moll \"FileSystem\" i deixeu-lo anar a la "
"propietat **Mob Scene**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:108
msgid ""
"Click the down arrow next to \"[empty]\" and choose \"Load\". Select "
"``mob.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic a la fletxa avall al costat de \"[empty]\" i trieu \"Carrega\". "
"Seleccioneu ``mob.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:110
msgid ""
"Next, select the instance of the ``Player`` scene under ``Main`` node in the "
"Scene dock, and access the Signals dock on the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"A continuació, seleccioneu la instància de l'escena ``Player`` al node "
"``Main`` al moll d'escena i accediu al moll de senyals a la barra lateral."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:113
msgid ""
"You should see a list of the signals for the ``Player`` node. Find and "
"double-click the ``hit`` signal in the list (or right-click it and select "
"\"Connect...\"). This will open the signal connection dialog. We want to "
"make a new function named ``game_over``, which will handle what needs to "
"happen when a game ends. Type \"game_over\" in the \"Receiver Method\" box "
"at the bottom of the signal connection dialog and click \"Connect\". You are "
"aiming to have the ``hit`` signal emitted from ``Player`` and handled in the "
"``Main`` script. Add the following code to the new function, as well as a "
"``new_game`` function that will set everything up for a new game:"
msgstr ""
"Hauríeu de veure una llista dels senyals per al node ``Player``. Cerqueu i "
"feu doble clic al senyal ``hit`` a la llista (o feu-hi clic amb el botó dret "
"i seleccioneu \"Connecta...\"). Això obrirà el diàleg de connexió del "
"senyal. Volem fer una nova funció anomenada ``game_over``, que gestionarà el "
"que ha de passar quan acabi un joc. Escriviu \"game_over\" al quadre "
"\"Mètode del receptor\" a la part inferior del diàleg de connexió del senyal "
"i feu clic a \"Connecta\". Teniu com a objectiu que el senyal de ``hit`` "
"s'emeti des del ``Player`` i es gestioni a l'script ``Main``. Afegiu el codi "
"següent a la nova funció, així com una funció ``new_game`` que configurarà "
"tot per a un joc nou:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:154
msgid ""
"Now we'll connect the ``timeout()`` signal of each Timer node "
"(``StartTimer``, ``ScoreTimer``, and ``MobTimer``) to the main script. For "
"each of the three timers, select the timer in the Scene dock, open the "
"Signals tab of the Node dock, then double-click the ``timeout()`` signal in "
"the list. This will open a new signal connection dialog. The default "
"settings in this dialog should be fine, so select **Connect** to create a "
"new signal connection."
msgstr ""
"Ara connectarem el senyal ``timeout()`` de cada node Timer (``StartTimer``, "
"``ScoreTimer`` i ``MobTimer``) a l'script principal. Per a cadascun dels "
"tres temporitzadors, seleccioneu el temporitzador al moll d'escena, obriu la "
"pestanya Senyals del moll Node i feu doble clic al senyal ``timeout()`` de "
"la llista. Això obrirà un diàleg de connexió de senyal nou. La configuració "
"predeterminada d'aquest diàleg hauria d'estar bé, així que seleccioneu "
"**Connecta** per crear una connexió de senyal nova."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:161
msgid ""
"Once all three timers have this set up, you should be able to see each timer "
"have a Signal connection for their respective ``timeout()`` signal, showing "
"in green, within their respective Signals tabs:"
msgstr ""
"Un cop els tres temporitzadors tinguin aquesta configuració, hauríeu de "
"poder veure que cada temporitzador té una connexió de senyal per al seu "
"respectiu senyal ``timeout()``, que es mostra en verd, a les seves "
"respectives pestanyes de senyals:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:165
msgid "(For MobTimer): ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(Per a MobTimer): ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:166
msgid "(For ScoreTimer): ``_on_score_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(Per a ScoreTimer): ``_on_score_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:167
msgid "(For StartTimer): ``_on_start_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(Per a StartTimer): ``_on_start_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:169
msgid ""
"Now we define how each of these timers operate by adding the code below. "
"Notice that ``StartTimer`` will start the other two timers, and that "
"``ScoreTimer`` will increment the score by 1."
msgstr ""
"Ara definim com funciona cadascun d'aquests temporitzadors afegint el codi "
"següent. Tingueu en compte que ``StartTimer`` iniciarà els altres dos "
"temporitzadors i que ``ScoreTimer`` augmentarà la puntuació en 1."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:198
msgid ""
"In ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``, we will create a mob instance, pick a random "
"starting location along the ``Path2D``, and set the mob in motion. The "
"``PathFollow2D`` node will automatically rotate as it follows the path, so "
"we will use that to select the mob's direction as well as its position. When "
"we spawn a mob, we'll pick a random value between ``150.0`` and ``250.0`` "
"for how fast each mob will move (it would be boring if they were all moving "
"at the same speed)."
msgstr ""
"A ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``, crearem una instància mob, escollirem una "
"ubicació inicial aleatòria al llarg de ``Path2D`` i posarem la mob en "
"moviment. El node ``PathFollow2D`` girarà automàticament a mesura que "
"segueix el camí, de manera que l'utilitzarem per seleccionar la direcció de "
"la màfia així com la seva posició. Quan generem un mob, triarem un valor "
"aleatori entre ``150.0`` i ``250.0`` per a la rapidesa amb què es mourà cada "
"mob (seria avorrit si tots es moguessin a la mateixa velocitat)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:206
msgid ""
"Note that a new instance must be added to the scene using ``add_child()``."
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que s'ha d'afegir una instància nova a l'escena usant "
"``add_child()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:266
msgid ""
"Why ``PI``? In functions requiring angles, Godot uses *radians*, not "
"degrees. Pi represents a half turn in radians, about ``3.1415`` (there is "
"also ``TAU`` which is equal to ``2 * PI``). If you're more comfortable "
"working with degrees, you'll need to use the ``deg_to_rad()`` and "
"``rad_to_deg()`` functions to convert between the two."
msgstr ""
"Per què ``PI``? En funcions que requereixen angles, Godot utilitza "
"*radians*, no graus. Pi representa mitja volta en radians, aproximadament "
"``3,1415`` (també hi ha ``TAU`` que és igual a ``2 * PI``). Si us sentiu més "
"còmode treballant amb graus, haureu d'utilitzar les funcions "
"``deg_to_rad()`` i ``rad_to_deg()`` per convertir entre les dues."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:274
msgid "Testing the scene"
msgstr "Prova de l'escena"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:276
msgid ""
"Let's test the scene to make sure everything is working. Add this "
"``new_game`` call to ``_ready()``:"
msgstr ""
"Provem l'escena per assegurar-nos que tot funciona. Afegiu aquesta crida de "
"``new_game`` a ``_ready()``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:292
msgid ""
"Let's also assign ``Main`` as our \"Main Scene\" - the one that runs "
"automatically when the game launches. Press the \"Play\" button and select "
"``main.tscn`` when prompted."
msgstr ""
"També assignem ``Principal`` com a \"Escena principal\", la que s'executa "
"automàticament quan s'inicia el joc. Premeu el botó \"Reproduir\" i "
"seleccioneu ``main.tscn`` quan se us demani."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:296
msgid ""
"If you had already set another scene as the \"Main Scene\", you can right "
"click ``main.tscn`` in the FileSystem dock and select \"Set As Main Scene\"."
msgstr ""
"Si ja havíeu establert una altra escena com a \"Escena principal\", podeu "
"fer clic amb el botó dret a ``main.tscn`` al moll del sistema de fitxers i "
"seleccionar \"Estableix com a escena principal\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:299
msgid ""
"You should be able to move the player around, see mobs spawning, and see the "
"player disappear when hit by a mob."
msgstr ""
"Hauríeu de poder moure el jugador, veure com apareixen les màfies i veure "
"com el jugador desapareix quan és colpejat per una màfia."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:302
msgid ""
"When you're sure everything is working, remove the call to ``new_game()`` "
"from ``_ready()`` and replace it with ``pass``."
msgstr ""
"Quan estigueu segur que tot funciona, elimineu la crida a ``new_game()`` de "
"``_ready()`` i substituïu-la per ``pass``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:305
msgid ""
"What's our game lacking? Some user interface. In the next lesson, we'll add "
"a title screen and display the player's score."
msgstr ""
"Què ens falta al nostre joc? Alguna interfície d'usuari. A la lliçó següent, "
"afegirem una pantalla de títol i mostrarem la puntuació del jugador."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:4
msgid "Heads up display"
msgstr "Pantalla de capçalera"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:6
msgid ""
"The final piece our game needs is a User Interface (UI) to display things "
"like score, a \"game over\" message, and a restart button."
msgstr ""
"L'última peça que necessita el nostre joc és una interfície d'usuari (UI) "
"per mostrar coses com la puntuació, un missatge de \"joc acabat\" i un botó "
"de reinici."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:9
msgid ""
"Create a new scene, click the \"Other Node\" button and add "
"a :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` node named ``HUD``. \"HUD\" stands "
"for \"heads-up display\", an informational display that appears as an "
"overlay on top of the game view."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una escena nova, feu clic al botó \"Altre node\" i afegiu un "
"node :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` anomenat ``HUD``. \"HUD\" "
"significa \"heads-up display\", una pantalla informativa que apareix com una "
"superposició a la part superior de la vista del joc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:13
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` node lets us draw our UI elements "
"on a layer above the rest of the game, so that the information it displays "
"isn't covered up by any game elements like the player or mobs."
msgstr ""
"El node :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` ens permet dibuixar els "
"nostres elements de la interfície d'usuari en una capa per sobre de la resta "
"del joc, de manera que la informació que mostra no estigui coberta per cap "
"element del joc com el jugador o els mobs."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:17
msgid "The HUD needs to display the following information:"
msgstr "L'HUD ha de mostrar la informació següent:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:19
msgid "Score, changed by ``ScoreTimer``."
msgstr "La puntuació, canviada per ``ScoreTimer``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:20
msgid "A message, such as \"Game Over\" or \"Get Ready!\""
msgstr "Un missatge, com ara \"Game Over\" o \"Get Ready!\""

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:21
msgid "A \"Start\" button to begin the game."
msgstr "Un botó \"Inici\" per començar el joc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:23
msgid ""
"The basic node for UI elements is :ref:`Control <class_Control>`. To create "
"our UI, we'll use two types of :ref:`Control <class_Control>` "
"nodes: :ref:`Label <class_Label>` and :ref:`Button <class_Button>`."
msgstr ""
"El node bàsic per als elements de la IU és :ref:`Control <class_Control>`. "
"Per crear la nostra interfície d'usuari, utilitzarem dos tipus de "
"nodes :ref:`Control <class_Control>`: :ref:`Label <class_Label>` "
"i :ref:`Botó <class_Button>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:27
msgid "Create the following as children of the ``HUD`` node:"
msgstr "Creeu el següent com a fills del node ``HUD``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` named ``ScoreLabel``."
msgstr ":ref:`Etiqueta <class_Label>` anomenada ``ScoreLabel``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` named ``Message``."
msgstr ":ref:`Etiqueta <class_Label>` anomenada ``Missatge``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:31
msgid ":ref:`Button <class_Button>` named ``StartButton``."
msgstr ":ref:`Botó <class_Button>` anomenat ``StartButton``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:32
msgid ":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` named ``MessageTimer``."
msgstr ":ref:`Temporitzador <class_Timer>` anomenat ``MessageTimer``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:34
msgid ""
"Click on the ``ScoreLabel`` and type a number into the ``Text`` field in the "
"Inspector. The default font for ``Control`` nodes is small and doesn't scale "
"well. There is a font file included in the game assets called \"Xolonium-"
"Regular.ttf\". To use this font, do the following:"
msgstr ""
"Feu clic a ``ScoreLabel`` i escriviu un número al camp ``Text`` de "
"l'Inspector. El tipus de lletra per defecte dels nodes ``Control`` és petit "
"i no escala bé. Als recursos del joc hi ha un fitxer de tipus de lletra "
"anomenat \"Xolonium-Regular.ttf\". Per usar aquest tipus de lletra, feu el "
"següent:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:39
msgid ""
"Under \"Theme Overrides > Fonts\", choose \"Load\" and select the \"Xolonium-"
"Regular.ttf\" file."
msgstr ""
"A \"Modificacions de temes > Tipus de lletra\", trieu \"Carrega\" i "
"seleccioneu el fitxer \"Xolonium-Regular.ttf\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:43
msgid ""
"The font size is still too small, increase it to ``64`` under \"Theme "
"Overrides > Font Sizes\". Once you've done this with the ``ScoreLabel``, "
"repeat the changes for the ``Message`` and ``StartButton`` nodes."
msgstr ""
"La mida de la lletra encara és massa petita, augmenta-la a ``64`` a "
"\"Substitucions de temes > Mides de lletra\". Un cop hàgiu fet això amb la "
"``ScoreLabel``, repetiu els canvis per als nodes ``Message`` i "
"``StartButton``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Anchors:** ``Control`` nodes have a position and size, but they also have "
"anchors. Anchors define the origin - the reference point for the edges of "
"the node."
msgstr ""
"**Ancores:** els nodes ``Control`` tenen una posició i una mida, però també "
"tenen ancoratges. Les àncores defineixen l'origen: el punt de referència de "
"les vores del node."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:52
msgid ""
"Arrange the nodes as shown below. You can drag the nodes to place them "
"manually, or for more precise placement, use \"Anchor Presets\"."
msgstr ""
"Organitzeu els nodes com es mostra a continuació. Podeu arrossegar els nodes "
"per col·locar-los manualment o, per a una col·locació més precisa, utilitzeu "
"\"Preestablerts d'ancoratge\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:59
msgid "ScoreLabel"
msgstr "ScoreLabel"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:61
msgid "Add the text ``0``."
msgstr "Afegiu el text ``0``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:62
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:69
msgid ""
"Set the \"Horizontal Alignment\" and \"Vertical Alignment\" to ``Center``."
msgstr ""
"Estableix \"Alineació horitzontal\" i \"Alineació vertical\" a ``Centre``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:63
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center Top``."
msgstr "Trieu el \"Preset d'ancoratge\" ``Center Top``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:66
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Missatge"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:68
msgid "Add the text ``Dodge the Creeps!``."
msgstr "Afegiu el text ``Dodge the Creeps!``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:70
msgid ""
"Set the \"Autowrap Mode\" to ``Word``, otherwise the label will stay on one "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el \"Mode d'embolcall automàtic\" a ``Paraula``, en cas contrari, "
"l'etiqueta es mantindrà en una línia."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:71
msgid ""
"Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\" set \"Size X\"  to ``480`` to use the "
"entire width of the screen."
msgstr ""
"A \"Control - Disseny/Transformació\", establiu \"Mida X\" a ``480`` per "
"utilitzar tota l'amplada de la pantalla."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:72
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center``."
msgstr "Trieu el \"Preset d'ancoratge\" ``Centre``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:75
msgid "StartButton"
msgstr "StartButton"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:77
msgid "Add the text ``Start``."
msgstr "Afegiu el text ``Inici``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:78
msgid ""
"Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\", set \"Size X\" to ``200`` and \"Size "
"Y\" to ``100`` to add a little bit more padding between the border and text."
msgstr ""
"A \"Control - Disseny/Transformació\", establiu \"Mida X\" a ``200`` i "
"\"Mida Y\" a ``100`` per afegir una mica més de farciment entre la vora i el "
"text."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:80
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center Bottom``."
msgstr "Trieu el \"Preset d'ancoratge\" ``Center Bottom``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:81
msgid "Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\", set \"Position Y\" to ``580``."
msgstr ""
"A \"Control - Disseny/Transformació\", establiu \"Posició Y\" a ``580``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:83
msgid ""
"On the ``MessageTimer``, set the ``Wait Time`` to ``2`` and set the ``One "
"Shot`` property to \"On\"."
msgstr ""
"Al ``MessageTimer``, configureu el ``Wait Time`` a ``2`` i configureu la "
"propietat ``One Shot`` a \"On\"."

