msgid ""
"We can see some empty space around the character due to the perspective "
"projection. In this game, we're going to use an orthographic projection "
"instead to better frame the gameplay area and make it easier for the player "
"to read distances."
msgstr ""
"Podem veure algun espai buit al voltant del personatge a causa de la "
"projecció en perspectiva. En aquest joc, farem servir una projecció "
"ortogràfica per emmarcar millor l'àrea de joc i facilitar que el jugador "
"pugui llegir les distàncies."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:427
msgid ""
"Select the *Camera* again and in the *Inspector*, set the *Projection* to "
"*Orthogonal* and the *Size* to ``19``. The character should now look flatter "
"and the ground should fill the background."
msgstr ""
"Torneu a seleccionar la *Càmera* i, a *Inspector*, configureu la *Projecció* "
"a *Ortogonal* i la *Mida* a ``19``. Ara el personatge hauria de semblar més "
"pla i el sòl hauria d'omplir el fons."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:433
msgid ""
"When using an orthogonal camera in Godot 4, directional shadow quality is "
"dependent on the camera's *Far* value. The higher the *Far* value, the "
"further away the camera will be able to see. However, higher *Far* values "
"also decrease shadow quality as the shadow rendering has to cover a greater "
"distance."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'utilitza una càmera ortogonal a Godot 4, la qualitat de l'ombra "
"direccional depèn del valor *Far* de la càmera. Com més gran sigui el valor "
"de *Far*, més lluny podrà veure la càmera. Tanmateix, els valors *Far* més "
"alts també disminueixen la qualitat de l'ombra, ja que la representació de "
"l'ombra ha de cobrir una distància més gran."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:439
msgid ""
"If directional shadows look too blurry after switching to an orthogonal "
"camera, decrease the camera's *Far* property to a lower value such as "
"``100``. Don't decrease this *Far* property too much, or objects in the "
"distance will start disappearing."
msgstr ""
"Si les ombres direccionals semblen massa borroses després de canviar a una "
"càmera ortogonal, reduïu la propietat *Far* de la càmera a un valor més "
"baix, com ara ``100``. No reduïu massa aquesta propietat *Far*, o els "
"objectes a distància començaran a desaparèixer."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:444
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:226
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:87
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/06.jump_and_squash.rst:198
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/08.score_and_replay.rst:191
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/09.adding_animations.rst:91
#: ../../docs/community/asset_library/using_assetlib.rst:159
msgid "|image10|"
msgstr "|imatge 10|"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:461
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:337
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:356
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/06.jump_and_squash.rst:384
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/08.score_and_replay.rst:458
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/09.adding_animations.rst:626
#: ../../docs/community/asset_library/using_assetlib.rst:196
msgid "image10"
msgstr "imatge 10"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:446
msgid ""
"Test your scene and you should be able to move in all 8 directions and not "
"glitch through the floor!"
msgstr ""
"Posa a prova la teva escena i hauries de poder moure't en les 8 direccions i "
"no passar pel terra!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:448
msgid ""
"Ultimately, we have both player movement and the view in place. Next, we "
"will work on the monsters."
msgstr ""
"En última instància, tenim tant el moviment del jugador com la vista al seu "
"lloc. A continuació, treballarem els monstres."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:4
msgid "Designing the mob scene"
msgstr "Disseny de l'escena dels enemics"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this part, you're going to code the monsters, which we'll call mobs. In "
"the next lesson, we'll spawn them randomly around the playable area."
msgstr ""
"En aquesta part, codificareu els monstres, que anomenarem mobs. A la lliçó "
"següent, els generarem aleatòriament per l'àrea de joc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:9
msgid ""
"Let's design the monsters themselves in a new scene. The node structure is "
"going to be similar to the ``player.tscn`` scene."
msgstr ""
"Dissenyem els mateixos monstres en una nova escena. L'estructura del node "
"serà similar a l'escena ``player.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:12
msgid ""
"Create a scene with, once again, a :ref:`CharacterBody3D "
"<class_CharacterBody3D>` node as its root. Name it ``Mob``. Add a child "
"node :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>`, name it ``Pivot``. And drag and drop the "
"file ``mob.glb`` from the *FileSystem* dock onto the ``Pivot`` to add the "
"monster's 3D model to the scene."
msgstr ""
"Creeu una escena amb, una vegada més, un node :ref:`CharacterBody3D "
"<class_CharacterBody3D>` com a arrel. Anomeneu-lo ``Mob``. Afegiu un node "
"fill :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>`, anomeneu-lo ``Pivot``. I arrossegueu i "
"deixeu anar el fitxer ``mob.glb`` des del moll *FileSystem* al ``Pivot`` per "
"afegir el model 3D del monstre a l'escena."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:19
msgid "You can rename the newly created ``mob`` node into ``Character``."
msgstr "Podeu canviar el nom del node ``mob`` acabat de crear a ``Caracter``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:24
msgid ""
"We need a collision shape for our body to work. Right-click on the ``Mob`` "
"node, the scene's root, and click *Add Child Node*."
msgstr ""
"Necessitem una forma de col·lisió perquè el nostre cos funcioni. Feu clic "
"amb el botó dret al node ``Mob``, l'arrel de l'escena, i feu clic a *Afegeix "
"un node secundari*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:29
msgid "Add a :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`."
msgstr "Afegiu un :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:34
msgid "In the *Inspector*, assign a *BoxShape3D* to the *Shape* property."
msgstr "A *Inspector*, assigneu un *BoxShape3D* a la propietat *Shape*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:38
msgid ""
"We should change its size to fit the 3D model better. You can do so "
"interactively by clicking and dragging on the orange dots."
msgstr ""
"Hauríem de canviar la seva mida per adaptar-se millor al model 3D. Podeu fer-"
"ho de manera interactiva fent clic i arrossegant els punts taronges."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:41
msgid ""
"The box should touch the floor and be a little thinner than the model. "
"Physics engines work in such a way that if the player's sphere touches even "
"the box's corner, a collision will occur. If the box is a little too big "
"compared to the 3D model, you may die at a distance from the monster, and "
"the game will feel unfair to the players."
msgstr ""
"La caixa ha de tocar el terra i ser una mica més prima que el model. Els "
"motors físics funcionen de tal manera que si l'esfera del jugador toca fins "
"i tot la cantonada de la caixa, es produirà una col·lisió. Si la caixa és "
"una mica massa gran en comparació amb el model 3D, és possible que moris a "
"distància del monstre i el joc se sentirà injust amb els jugadors."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:49
msgid ""
"Notice that my box is taller than the monster. It is okay in this game "
"because we're looking at the scene from above and using a fixed perspective. "
"Collision shapes don't have to match the model exactly. It's the way the "
"game feels when you test it that should dictate their form and size."
msgstr ""
"Fixeu-vos que la meva caixa és més alta que el monstre. En aquest joc està "
"bé perquè mirem l'escena des de dalt i utilitzem una perspectiva fixa. Les "
"formes de col·lisió no han de coincidir exactament amb el model. És la forma "
"en què se sent el joc quan el proveu que hauria de dictar la seva forma i "
"mida."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:55
msgid "Removing monsters off-screen"
msgstr "Eliminació de monstres fora de la pantalla"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:57
msgid ""
"We're going to spawn monsters at regular time intervals in the game level. "
"If we're not careful, their count could increase to infinity, and we don't "
"want that. Each mob instance has both a memory and a processing cost, and we "
"don't want to pay for it when the mob is outside the screen."
msgstr ""
"Generarem monstres a intervals de temps regulars al nivell de joc. Si no "
"anem amb compte, el seu recompte podria augmentar fins a l'infinit, i això "
"no ho volem. Cada instància de mafia té una memòria i un cost de "
"processament, i no volem pagar-ho quan la màfia estigui fora de la pantalla."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:62
msgid ""
"Once a monster leaves the screen, we don't need it anymore, so we should "
"delete it. Godot has a node that detects when objects leave the "
"screen, :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`, "
"and we're going to use it to destroy our mobs."
msgstr ""
"Un cop un monstre surt de la pantalla, ja no el necessitem, així que hauríem "
"d'eliminar-lo. Godot té un node que detecta quan els objectes surten de la "
"pantalla, :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`, i el farem servir per destruir els "
"nostres mobs."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:68
msgid ""
"When you keep instancing an object, there's a technique you can use to avoid "
"the cost of creating and destroying instances all the time called pooling. "
"It consists of pre-creating an array of objects and reusing them over and "
"over."
msgstr ""
"Quan continueu instància d'un objecte, hi ha una tècnica que podeu utilitzar "
"per evitar el cost de crear i destruir instàncies tot el temps anomenada "
"agrupació. Consisteix a crear prèviament una matriu d'objectes i reutilitzar-"
"los una i altra vegada."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:73
msgid ""
"When working with GDScript, this usually isn't needed. The main reason to "
"use pools is to avoid freezes with garbage-collected languages like C# or "
"Lua. GDScript uses a different technique to manage memory, reference "
"counting, which doesn't have that caveat. You can learn more about that "
"here: :ref:`doc_gdscript_basics_memory_management`."
msgstr ""
"Quan es treballa amb GDScript, això normalment no és necessari. La raó "
"principal per utilitzar les agrupacions és evitar les congelacions amb "
"llenguatges recollits a les escombraries com C# o Lua. GDScript utilitza una "
"tècnica diferent per gestionar la memòria, el recompte de referències, que "
"no té aquesta advertència. Podeu obtenir més informació sobre això "
"aquí: :ref:`doc_gdscript_basics_memory_management`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:79
msgid ""
"Select the ``Mob`` node and add a child node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`. Another box, pink this time, appears. "
"When this box completely leaves the screen, the node will emit a signal."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu el node ``Mob`` i afegiu un node "
"fill :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`. "
"Apareix una altra caixa, rosa aquesta vegada. Quan aquesta caixa surt "
"completament de la pantalla, el node emetrà un senyal."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:85
msgid "Resize it using the orange dots until it covers the entire 3D model."
msgstr ""
"Canvieu la mida usant els punts taronges fins que cobreixi tot el model 3D."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:90
msgid "Coding the mob's movement"
msgstr "Codificació del moviment de la mafia"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:92
msgid ""
"Let's implement the monster's motion. We're going to do this in two steps. "
"First, we'll write a script on the ``Mob`` that defines a function to "
"initialize the monster. We'll then code the randomized spawn mechanism in "
"the ``main.tscn`` scene and call the function from there."
msgstr ""
"Implementem el moviment del monstre. Ho farem en dos passos. Primer, "
"escriurem un script a la ``Mob`` que defineix una funció per inicialitzar el "
"monstre. Després codificarem el mecanisme de generació aleatòria a l'escena "
"``main.tscn`` i cridarem la funció des d'allà."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:97
msgid "Attach a script to the ``Mob``."
msgstr "Adjunteu un script a ``Mob``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:101
msgid ""
"Here's the movement code to start with. We define two properties, "
"``min_speed`` and ``max_speed``, to define a random speed range, which we "
"will later use to define ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``."
msgstr ""
"Aquí teniu el codi de moviment per començar. Definim dues propietats, "
"``min_speed`` i ``max_speed``, per definir un rang de velocitat aleatori, "
"que després utilitzarem per definir ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:139
msgid ""
"Similarly to the player, we move the mob every frame by calling the function "
"``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()``. This time, we don't update the "
"``velocity`` every frame; we want the monster to move at a constant speed "
"and leave the screen, even if it were to hit an obstacle."
msgstr ""
"De manera similar al reproductor, movem el mob cada fotograma cridant a la "
"funció ``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()``. Aquesta vegada, no actualitzem "
"la ``velocity`` a cada fotograma; volem que el monstre es mogui a una "
"velocitat constant i surti de la pantalla, encara que toqui un obstacle."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:144
msgid ""
"We need to define another function to calculate the "
"``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. This function will turn the monster towards "
"the player and randomize both its angle of motion and its velocity."
msgstr ""
"Hem de definir una altra funció per calcular la "
"``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. Aquesta funció girarà el monstre cap al "
"jugador i aleatoritzarà tant el seu angle de moviment com la seva velocitat."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:148
msgid ""
"The function will take a ``start_position``,the mob's spawn position, and "
"the ``player_position`` as its arguments."
msgstr ""
"La funció prendrà com a arguments una ``start_position``, la posició de "
"generació de la mafia i la ``player_position``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:151
msgid ""
"We position the mob at ``start_position`` and turn it towards the player "
"using the ``look_at_from_position()`` method, and randomize the angle by "
"rotating a random amount around the Y axis. Below, ``randf_range()`` outputs "
"a random value between ``-PI / 4`` radians and ``PI / 4`` radians."
msgstr ""
"Posicionem el mob a ``start_position`` i el girem cap al jugador mitjançant "
"el mètode ``look_at_from_position()``, i aleatoritzem l'angle girant una "
"quantitat aleatòria al voltant de l'eix Y. A continuació, ``randf_range()`` "
"genera un valor aleatori entre ``-PI / 4`` radians i ``PI / 4`` radians."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:181
msgid ""
"We got a random position, now we need a ``random_speed``. ``randi_range()`` "
"will be useful as it gives random int values, and we will use ``min_speed`` "
"and ``max_speed``. ``random_speed`` is just an integer, and we just use it "
"to multiply our ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. After ``random_speed`` is "
"applied, we rotate ``CharacterBody3D.velocity`` Vector3 towards the player."
msgstr ""
"Tenim una posició aleatòria, ara necessitem una ``random_speed``. "
"``randi_range()`` serà útil ja que dóna valors int aleatoris, i utilitzarem "
"``min_speed`` i ``max_speed``. ``random_speed`` és només un nombre enter, i "
"només l'utilitzem per multiplicar la nostra ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. "
"Després d'aplicar ``random_speed``, girem ``CharacterBody3D.velocity`` "
"Vector3 cap al reproductor."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:214
msgid "Leaving the screen"
msgstr "Sortida de la pantalla"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:216
msgid ""
"We still have to destroy the mobs when they leave the screen. To do so, "
"we'll connect our :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` node's ``screen_exited`` signal to the "
"``Mob``."
msgstr ""
"Encara hem de destruir les turbes quan surten de la pantalla. Per fer-ho, "
"connectarem el senyal ``screen_exited`` del nostre "
"node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` al "
"``Mob``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:219
msgid ""
"Select the :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` node and on the right side of the "
"interface, navigate to the *Signals* dock. Double-click the "
"``screen_exited()`` signal."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu el node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` i al costat dret de la interfície, "
"navegueu fins al moll *Signals*. Feu doble clic al senyal "
"``screen_exited()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:224
msgid "Connect the signal to the ``Mob``"
msgstr "Connecteu el senyal a la ``Mob``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:228
msgid ""
"This will add a new function for you in your mob script, "
"``_on_visible_on_screen_notifier_3d_screen_exited()``. From it, call the "
"``queue_free()`` method. This function destroys the instance it's called on."
msgstr ""
"Això afegirà una funció nova al vostre script mob, "
"``_on_visible_on_screen_notifier_3d_screen_exited()``. Des d'ell, crida al "
"mètode ``queue_free()``. Aquesta funció destrueix la instància a la qual es "
"crida."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:247
msgid ""
"Our monster is ready to enter the game! In the next part, you will spawn "
"monsters in the game level."
msgstr ""
"El nostre monstre està preparat per entrar al joc! A la següent part, "
"generaràs monstres al nivell del joc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:250
msgid "Here is the complete ``mob.gd`` script for reference."
msgstr "Aquí teniu l'script ``mob.gd`` complet com a referència."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:4
msgid "Spawning monsters"
msgstr "Generació de monstres"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this part, we're going to spawn monsters along a path randomly. By the "
"end, you will have monsters roaming the game board."
msgstr ""
"En aquesta part, generarem monstres per un camí aleatòriament. Al final, "
"tindreu monstres deambulant pel tauler de joc."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:11
msgid ""
"Double-click on ``main.tscn`` in the *FileSystem* dock to open the ``Main`` "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"Feu doble clic a ``main.tscn`` al moll *FileSystem* per obrir l'escena "
"``Main``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:13
msgid ""
"Before drawing the path, we're going to change the game resolution. Our game "
"has a default window size of ``1152x648``. We're going to set it to "
"``720x540``, a nice little box."
msgstr ""
"Abans de dibuixar el camí, canviarem la resolució del joc. El nostre joc té "
"una mida de finestra predeterminada de ``1152x648``. L'establirem a "
"``720x540``, una petita caixa agradable."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:17
msgid "Go to *Project -> Project Settings*."
msgstr "Fitxers del projecte"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:21
msgid "If you still have *Input Map* open, switch to the *General* tab."
msgstr ""
"Si encara teniu obert el *Mapa d'entrada*, canvieu a la pestanya *General*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:23
msgid ""
"In the left menu, navigate down to *Display -> Window*. On the right, set "
"the *Viewport Width* to ``720`` and the *Viewport Height* to ``540``."
msgstr ""
"Al menú de l'esquerra, aneu cap avall fins a *Pantalla -> Finestra*. A la "
"dreta, establiu *Amplada de la finestra* a ``720`` i la *Alçada de la "
"finestra* a ``540``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:29
msgid "Creating the spawn path"
msgstr "Creació del camí de generació"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:31
msgid ""
"Like you did in the 2D game tutorial, you're going to design a path and use "
"a :ref:`PathFollow3D <class_PathFollow3D>` node to sample random locations "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Com heu fet al tutorial del joc en 2D, dissenyareu un camí i utilitzareu un "
"node :ref:`PathFollow3D <class_PathFollow3D>` per mostrar-hi ubicacions "
"aleatòries."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:34
msgid ""
"In 3D though, it's a bit more complicated to draw the path. We want it to be "
"around the game view so monsters appear right outside the screen. But if we "
"draw a path, we won't see it from the camera preview."
msgstr ""
"En 3D, però, és una mica més complicat dibuixar el camí. Volem que estigui "
"al voltant de la vista del joc perquè els monstres apareguin just fora de la "
"pantalla. Però si dibuixem un camí, no el veurem des de la vista prèvia de "
"la càmera."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:38
msgid ""
"To find the view's limits, we can use some placeholder meshes. Your viewport "
"should still be split into two parts, with the camera preview at the bottom. "
"If that isn't the case, press :kbd:`Ctrl + 2` (:kbd:`Cmd + 2` on macOS) to "
"split the view into two. Select the :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` node "
"and click the *Preview* checkbox in the bottom viewport."
msgstr ""
"Per trobar els límits de la vista, podem utilitzar algunes malles de "
"marcador de posició. La vostra finestra encara s'hauria de dividir en dues "
"parts, amb la vista prèvia de la càmera a la part inferior. Si no és així, "
"premeu :kbd:`Ctrl + 2` (:kbd:`Cmd + 2` a macOS) per dividir la vista en "
"dues. Seleccioneu el node :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` i feu clic a la "
"casella de selecció *Vista prèvia* a la finestra inferior."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:47
msgid "Adding placeholder cylinders"
msgstr "Afegir cilindres de marcador de posició"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:49
msgid ""
"Let's add the placeholder meshes. Add a new :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` as "
"a child of the ``Main`` node and name it ``Cylinders``. We'll use it to "
"group the cylinders. Select ``Cylinders`` and add a child "
"node :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>`"
msgstr ""
"Afegim les malles de marcador de posició. Afegiu un nou :ref:`Node3D "
"<class_Node3D>` com a fill del node ``Main`` i anomeneu-lo ``Cilindres``. "
"L'utilitzarem per agrupar els cilindres. Seleccioneu ``Cilindres`` i afegiu "
"un node fill :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>`"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:54
msgid "In the *Inspector*, assign a *CylinderMesh* to the *Mesh* property."
msgstr "A *Inspector*, assigneu un *CylinderMesh* a la propietat *Mesh*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:58
msgid ""
"Set the top viewport to the top orthogonal view using the menu in the "
"viewport's top-left corner. Alternatively, you can press the keypad's 7 key."
msgstr ""
"Estableix la finestra superior a la vista ortogonal superior mitjançant el "
"menú de l'extrem superior esquerre de la finestra. Alternativament, podeu "
"prémer la tecla 7 del teclat."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:63
msgid ""
"The grid may be distracting. You can toggle it by going to the *View* menu "
"in the toolbar and clicking *View Grid*."
msgstr ""
"La graella pot estar distraint. Podeu canviar-lo si aneu al menú "
"*Visualitza* de la barra d'eines i feu clic a *Visualitza la quadrícula*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:68
msgid ""
"You now want to move the cylinder along the ground plane, looking at the "
"camera preview in the bottom viewport. I recommend using grid snap to do so. "
"You can toggle it by clicking the magnet icon in the toolbar or pressing Y."
msgstr ""
"Ara voleu moure el cilindre al llarg del pla de terra, mirant la vista "
"prèvia de la càmera a la finestra inferior. Recomano utilitzar Grid Snap per "
"fer-ho. Podeu canviar-lo fent clic a la icona de l'imant a la barra d'eines "
"o prement Y."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:74
msgid ""
"Move the cylinder so it's right outside the camera's view in the top-left "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Mou el cilindre perquè quedi just fora de la vista de la càmera a la "
"cantonada superior esquerra."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:79
msgid ""
"We're going to create copies of the mesh and place them around the game "
"area. Press :kbd:`Ctrl + D` (:kbd:`Cmd + D` on macOS) to duplicate the node. "
"You can also right-click the node in the *Scene* dock and select "
"*Duplicate*. Move the copy down along the blue Z axis until it's right "
"outside the camera's preview."
msgstr ""
"Crearem còpies de la malla i les col·locarem al voltant de l'àrea de joc. "
"Premeu :kbd:`Ctrl + D` (:kbd:`Cmd + D` a macOS) per duplicar el node. També "
"podeu fer clic amb el botó dret al node al moll *Escena* i seleccionar "
"*Duplicar*. Mou la còpia cap avall al llarg de l'eix Z blau fins que quedi "
"just fora de la vista prèvia de la càmera."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:84
msgid ""
"Select both cylinders by pressing the :kbd:`Shift` key and clicking on the "
"unselected one and duplicate them."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu els dos cilindres prement la tecla :kbd:`Majúscules` i fent clic "
"al no seleccionat i dupliqueu-los."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:89
msgid "Move them to the right by dragging the red X axis."
msgstr "Mou-los cap a la dreta arrossegant l'eix X vermell."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:93
msgid ""
"They're a bit hard to see in white, aren't they? Let's make them stand out "
"by giving them a new material."
msgstr ""
"Són una mica difícils de veure en blanc, oi? Fem-los destacar donant-los un "
"nou material."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:96
msgid ""
"In 3D, materials define a surface's visual properties like its color, how it "
"reflects light, and more. We can use them to change the color of a mesh."
msgstr ""
"En 3D, els materials defineixen les propietats visuals d'una superfície com "
"el seu color, com reflecteix la llum i molt més. Les podem utilitzar per "
"canviar el color d'una malla."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:99
msgid ""
"We can update all four cylinders at once. Select all the mesh instances in "
"the *Scene* dock. To do so, you can click on the first one and Shift click "
"on the last one."
msgstr ""
"Podem actualitzar els quatre cilindres alhora. Seleccioneu totes les "
"instàncies de malla al moll *Escena*. Per fer-ho, podeu fer clic a la "
"primera i la tecla Maj clic a la darrera."

