msgid ""
"Portal and room occlusion culling was replaced by raster :ref:`occlusion "
"culling <doc_occlusion_culling>` (OccluderInstance3D node), which requires a "
"different setup process."
msgstr ""
"L'eliminació d'oclusió del portal i de la sala es va substituir per "
"ràster :ref:`occlusion culling <doc_occlusion_culling>` (node "
"OccluderInstance3D), que requereix un procés de configuració diferent."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:718
msgid "Room"
msgstr "Sala"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:720
msgid "RoomManager"
msgstr "RoomManager"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:722
msgid "RoomGroup"
msgstr "RoomGroup"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:724
msgid "Occluder"
msgstr "Mode Oclusió"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:724
msgid ""
"Geometry occlusion culling was replaced by raster :ref:`occlusion culling "
"<doc_occlusion_culling>` (OccluderInstance3D node), which requires a "
"different setup process."
msgstr ""
"L'eliminació d'oclusió de geometria es va substituir per "
"ràster :ref:`occlusion culling <doc_occlusion_culling>` (node "
"OccluderInstance3D), que requereix un procés de configuració diferent."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:728
msgid "OccluderShapeSphere"
msgstr "OccluderShapeSphere"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:728
msgid "Resource"
msgstr "Recurs"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:731
msgid ""
"If loading an old project, the node will be replaced with its *Closest "
"approximation* automatically (even if not using the project upgrade tool)."
msgstr ""
"Si carregueu un projecte antic, el node es substituirà automàticament per la "
"seva *aproximació més propera* (encara que no utilitzeu l'eina "
"d'actualització del projecte)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:734
msgid "**Threading changes**"
msgstr "**Canvis en el fil**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:736
msgid ""
":ref:`Threading <doc_using_multiple_threads>` APIs have changed in 4.0. For "
"example, the following code snippet in Godot 3.x must be modified to work in "
"4.0:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Threading <doc_using_multiple_threads>` Les API han canviat a la 4.0. "
"Per exemple, el fragment de codi següent a Godot 3.x s'ha de modificar "
"perquè funcioni en 4.0:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:749
msgid ""
"``Thread.is_active()`` is no longer used and should be converted to "
"``Thread.is_alive()``."
msgstr ""
"``Thread.is_active()`` ja no s'utilitza i s'ha de convertir a "
"``Thread.is_alive()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:753
msgid ""
"See the `changelog <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"CHANGELOG.md>`__ for a full list of changes between Godot 3.x and 4."
msgstr ""
"Vegeu el `changelog <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"CHANGELOG.md>`__ per obtenir una llista completa dels canvis entre Godot 3.x "
"i 4."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:757
msgid "ArrayMesh resource compatibility breakage"
msgstr "Ruptura de compatibilitat de recursos ArrayMesh"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:759
msgid ""
"If you've saved an ArrayMesh resource to a ``.res`` or ``.tres`` file, the "
"format used in 4.0 is not compatible with the one used in 3.x. You will need "
"to go through the process of importing the source mesh file and saving it as "
"an ArrayMesh resource again."
msgstr ""
"Si heu desat un recurs ArrayMesh en un fitxer ``.res`` o ``.tres``, el "
"format utilitzat a 4.0 no és compatible amb l'utilitzat a 3.x. Haureu de "
"passar pel procés d'importació del fitxer de malla d'origen i desar-lo de "
"nou com a recurs ArrayMesh."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:765
msgid ""
"List of automatically renamed methods, properties, signals and constants"
msgstr ""
"Llista de mètodes, propietats, senyals i constants amb canvi de nom "
"automàticament"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:767
msgid ""
"The `editor/project_upgrade/renames_map_3_to_4.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/project_upgrade/"
"renames_map_3_to_4.cpp>`__ source file lists all automatic renames performed "
"by the project upgrade tool. Lines that are commented out refer to API "
"renames that :ref:`cannot be performed automatically "
"<doc_upgrading_to_godot_4_manual_rename>`."
msgstr ""
"El fitxer font `editor/project_upgrade/renames_map_3_to_4.cpp <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/project_upgrade/"
"renames_map_3_to_4.cpp>`__ enumera tots els canvis de nom automàtics "
"realitzats per l'eina d'actualització del projecte. Les línies comentades "
"fan referència a canvis de nom de l'API que :ref:`no es poden realitzar "
"automàticament <doc_upgrading_to_godot_4_manual_rename>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:772
msgid "Porting editor settings"
msgstr "Migració dels paràmetres de l'editor"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:774
msgid ""
"Godot 3.x and 4.0 use different editor settings files. This means their "
"settings can be changed independently from each other."
msgstr ""
"Godot 3.x i 4.0 utilitzen diferents fitxers de configuració de l'editor. "
"Això significa que la seva configuració es pot canviar de manera independent "
"l'una de l'altra."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:777
msgid ""
"If you wish to port over your Godot 3.x settings to Godot 4, open "
"the :ref:`editor settings folder <doc_data_paths_editor_data_paths>` and "
"copy ``editor_settings-3.tres`` to ``editor_settings-4.tres`` while the "
"Godot 4 editor is closed."
msgstr ""
"Si voleu portar els paràmetres del Godot 3.x al Godot 4, obriu "
"la :ref:`carpeta de paràmetres de l'editor "
"<doc_data_paths_editor_data_paths>` i copieu ``editor_settings-3.tres`` a "
"``editor_settings-4.tres`` mentre l'editor del Godot 4 estigui tancat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:784
msgid ""
"Many settings' names and categories have changed since Godot 3.x. Editor "
"settings whose name or category has changed won't carry over to Godot 4.0; "
"you will have to set their values again."
msgstr ""
"Molts noms i categories de configuració han canviat des de Godot 3.x. La "
"configuració de l'editor el nom o la categoria dels quals hagi canviat no es "
"transferirà a Godot 4.0; haureu de tornar a establir els seus valors."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:790
msgid "Updating version control settings"
msgstr "Actualització dels paràmetres de control de versions"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:792
msgid ""
"Godot 3.x and 4.x have entirely different lists of files and folders that "
"should be ignored by your :ref:`version control "
"system<doc_version_control_systems>`."
msgstr ""
"Godot 3.x i 4.x tenen llistes de fitxers i carpetes completament diferents "
"que el vostre :ref:`sistema de control de "
"versions<doc_version_control_systems>` hauria d'ignorar."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading from Godot 4.0 to Godot 4.1"
msgstr "Actualització de Godot 4.0 a Godot 4.1"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"For most games and apps made with 4.0, it should be relatively safe to "
"migrate to 4.1. This page intends to cover everything you need to pay "
"attention to when migrating your project."
msgstr ""
"Per a la majoria de jocs i aplicacions fets amb 4.0, hauria de ser "
"relativament segur migrar a 4.1. Aquesta pàgina pretén cobrir tot el que "
"necessiteu parar atenció a l'hora de migrar el vostre projecte."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:11
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:11
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:11
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:11
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:11
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:11
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Canvis incompatibles"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you are migrating from 4.0 to 4.1, the breaking changes listed here might "
"affect you. Changes are grouped by areas/systems."
msgstr ""
"Si esteu migrant de la versió 4.0 a la 4.1, els canvis que s'indiquen aquí "
"us poden afectar. Els canvis s'agrupen per àrees/sistemes."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:18
msgid ""
"The GDExtension API completely breaks compatibility in 4.1, so it's not "
"included in the table below. See "
"the :ref:`updating_your_gdextension_for_godot_4_1` section for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"L'API GDExtension trenca completament la compatibilitat a 4.1, de manera que "
"no s'inclou a la taula següent. Consulteu la secció :ref:`actualitzant_la "
"vostra_gdextension_for_godot_4_1` per obtenir més informació."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:22
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:43
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:16
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:16
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:27
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:16
msgid ""
"This article indicates whether each breaking change affects GDScript and "
"whether the C# breaking change is *binary compatible* or *source compatible*:"
msgstr ""
"Aquest article indica si cada canvi de ruptura afecta GDScript i si el canvi "
"de ruptura de C# és *compatible binari* o *compatible amb la font*:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:25
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:46
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Binary compatible** - Existing binaries will load and execute successfully "
"without recompilation, and the runtime behavior won't change."
msgstr ""
"**Compatible amb binaris**: els binaris existents es carregaran i "
"s'executaran correctament sense recompilació, i el comportament en temps "
"d'execució no canviarà."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:27
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:48
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:21
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:21
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:32
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Source compatible** - Source code will compile successfully without "
"changes when upgrading Godot."
msgstr ""
"**Compatible amb la font** - El codi font es compilarà correctament sense "
"canvis en actualitzar Godot."

