#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:62
msgid ""
"The behavior of ``@export_file`` changed in Godot 4.4. When assigning a new "
"value from the Inspector, the path is now stored and returned as a ``uid://"
"`` reference instead of the traditional ``res://`` path(`GH-97912`_). This "
"is a **breaking change** and may cause issues if you're expecting ``res://``-"
"based paths in scripts or serialized files."
msgstr ""
"El comportament de ``@export_file`` va canviar a Godot 4.4. Quan s'assigna "
"un valor nou des de l'Inspector, el camí s'emmagatzema i es retorna com a "
"referència ``uid://`` en lloc de la ruta tradicional ``res://"
"``(`GH-97912`_). Aquest és un **canvi de ruptura** i pot causar problemes si "
"espereu camins basats en ``res://`` en scripts o fitxers serialitzats."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:68
msgid ""
"For example, exported arrays of files may now contain a mix of ``uid://`` "
"and ``res://`` paths, especially if they were partially edited in the "
"Inspector."
msgstr ""
"Per exemple, les matrius de fitxers exportats ara poden contenir una barreja "
"de camins ``uid://`` i ``res://``, especialment si s'han editat parcialment "
"a l'Inspector."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:71
msgid ""
"In 4.4, the only way to retain the ``res://`` format is to **manually edit** "
"the `.tscn` or `.tres` files in a text editor. Starting in Godot 4.5, a new "
"annotation ``@export_file_path`` can be used to explicitly retain the old "
"behavior and export raw ``res://`` paths."
msgstr ""
"A la versió 4.4, l'única manera de conservar el format ``res://`` és "
"**editar manualment** els fitxers `.tscn` o `.tres` en un editor de text. A "
"partir del Godot 4.5, es pot usar una anotació nova, ``@export_file_path``, "
"per conservar explícitament el comportament antic i exportar camins ``res://"
"`` en brut."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:76
msgid "Default buffer size in 4.3 is ``1024``."
msgstr "La mida de la memòria intermèdia predeterminada a 4.3 és ``1024``."

