msgid ""
"The method ``_get_import_flags`` was never used by the engine. It was "
"removed despite the compatibility breakage as there's no way for users to "
"rely on this affecting engine behavior."
msgstr ""
"El mètode ``_get_import_flags`` mai va ser utilitzat pel motor. Es va "
"eliminar malgrat la ruptura de compatibilitat, ja que no hi ha manera que "
"els usuaris confiïn en aquest comportament que afecta el motor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:180
msgid ""
"The ``Curve`` resource now enforces its value range, so ``min_value`` and "
"``max_value`` need to be changed if any of the points fall outside of the "
"default ``[0, 1]`` range."
msgstr ""
"El recurs ``Curve`` ara aplica el seu rang de valors, de manera que "
"``min_value`` i ``max_value`` s'han de canviar si algun dels punts queda "
"fora de l'interval predeterminat ``[0, 1]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:188
msgid ""
"The ``VisualShaderNodeVec4Constant`` shader node had its input type changed "
"to ``Vector4``. Users need to recreate the values in their constants."
msgstr ""
"El tipus d'entrada del node d'ombra ``VisualShaderNodeVec4Constant`` va "
"canviar a ``Vector4``. Els usuaris han de recrear els valors a les seves "
"constants."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:192
msgid "CSG"
msgstr "CSG"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:196
msgid ""
"The CSG implementation now uses Emmett Lalish's `Manifold <https://"
"github.com/elalish/manifold>`_ library (`GH-94321`_). The new implementation "
"is more consistent with manifold definitions and fixes a number of bugs and "
"stability issues. As a result, non-manifold meshes are no longer supported. "
"You can use ``MeshInstance3D`` for rendering non-manifold geometry, such as "
"quads or planes."
msgstr ""
"La implementació de CSG ara utilitza la biblioteca `Manifold <https://"
"github.com/elalish/manifold>`_ d'Emmett Lalish (`GH-94321`_). La nova "
"implementació és més coherent amb diverses definicions i soluciona una sèrie "
"d'errors i problemes d'estabilitat. Com a resultat, les malles no múltiples "
"ja no són compatibles. Podeu utilitzar ``MeshInstance3D`` per representar "
"geometries que no són múltiples, com ara quads o plans."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:206
msgid ""
"Android sensor events are no longer enabled by default (`GH-94799`_). "
"Projects that use sensor events can enable them as needed in Project "
"Settings under **Input Devices > Sensors**."
msgstr ""
"Els esdeveniments del sensor d'Android ja no estan activats de manera "
"predeterminada (`GH-94799`_). Els projectes que utilitzen esdeveniments de "
"sensor poden activar-los segons sigui necessari a la configuració del "
"projecte a **Dispositius d'entrada > Sensors**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading from Godot 4.4 to Godot 4.5"
msgstr "Actualització de Godot 4.4 a Godot 4.5"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"For most games and apps made with 4.4 it should be relatively safe to "
"migrate to 4.5. This page intends to cover everything you need to pay "
"attention to when migrating your project."
msgstr ""
"Per a la majoria de jocs i aplicacions fets amb 4.4, hauria de ser "
"relativament segur migrar a 4.5. Aquesta pàgina pretén cobrir tot el que "
"necessiteu parar atenció a l'hora de migrar el vostre projecte."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you are migrating from 4.4 to 4.5, the breaking changes listed here might "
"affect you. Changes are grouped by areas/systems."
msgstr ""
"Si esteu migrant de la 4.4 a la 4.5, els canvis que s'indiquen aquí us poden "
"afectar. Els canvis s'agrupen per àrees/sistemes."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"In order to support `new Google Play requirements`_ Android now requires "
"targeting .NET 9 when exporting C# projects to Android, other platforms "
"continue to use .NET 8 as the minimum required version but newer versions "
"are supported and encouraged."
msgstr ""
"Per tal de donar suport als \"nous requisits de Google Play\"_ Android ara "
"requereix orientar-se a .NET 9 quan s'exporten projectes C# a Android, "
"altres plataformes continuen utilitzant .NET 8 com a versió mínima "
"necessària, però s'admeten i recomanen les versions més noves."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you are using C# in your project and want to export to Android, you will "
"need to upgrade your project to .NET 9 (see `Upgrading to a new .NET "
"version`_ for instructions)."
msgstr ""
"Si utilitzeu C# al vostre projecte i voleu exportar-lo a Android, haureu "
"d'actualitzar el vostre projecte a .NET 9 (vegeu `Actualització a una nova "
"versió de .NET`_ per obtenir instruccions)."

