"``OpenXRInteractionProfileEditor`` i ``OpenXRInteractionProfileEditorBase`` "
"només estan disponibles a l'editor. Si els feu servir fora de l'editor, es "
"produirà un error de compilació."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:169
msgid ""
"In C#, this means the types are moved from the ``GodotSharp`` assembly to "
"the ``GodotSharpEditor`` assembly. Make sure to wrap code that uses these "
"types in a ``#if TOOLS`` block to ensure they are not included in an "
"exported game."
msgstr ""
"En C#, això significa que els tipus es mouen des del conjunt ``GodotSharp`` "
"al conjunt ``GodotSharpEditor``. Assegureu-vos d'embolicar el codi que "
"utilitza aquests tipus en un bloc ``#if TOOLS`` per assegurar-vos que no "
"s'incloguin en un joc exportat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:172
