#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:451
msgid ""
"And finally we will use the method :ref:`draw_polyline "
"<class_CanvasItem_method_draw_polyline>` to actually draw the line, like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"I, finalment, utilitzarem el mètode :ref:`draw_polyline "
"<class_CanvasItem_method_draw_polyline>` per dibuixar realment la línia, "
