"We will use the :ref:`draw_string <class_CanvasItem_method_draw_string>` "
"method to do it, like this:"
msgstr ""
"Utilitzarem el mètode :ref:`draw_string "
"<class_CanvasItem_method_draw_string>` per fer-ho, com aquest:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:669
msgid ""
