"posicionar-lo i escalar-lo adequadament, com fan la majoria de nodes."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:690
msgid ""
"To show the logo directly on the editor (without running it), you can use "
"the :ref:`@tool<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>` annotation to request the custom "
"drawing of the node to also appear while editing, like this:"
msgstr ""
"Per mostrar el logotip directament a l'editor (sense executar-lo), podeu "
"utilitzar l'anotació :ref:`@tool<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>` per sol·licitar "
