#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:4
msgid "Exporting for iOS"
msgstr "Exportació per a iOS"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page describes how to export a Godot project to iOS. If you're looking "
"to compile export template binaries from source instead, "
"read :ref:`doc_compiling_for_ios`."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta pàgina descriu com exportar un projecte Godot a iOS. Si voleu "
"compilar binaris de plantilles d'exportació des de la font, "
"llegiu :ref:`doc_compiling_for_ios`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:12
msgid ""
"These are the steps to load a Godot project in Xcode. This allows you to "
"build and deploy to an iOS device, build a release for the App Store, and do "
"everything else you can normally do with Xcode."
msgstr ""
"Aquests són els passos per carregar un projecte Godot a Xcode. Això us "
"permet crear i implementar en un dispositiu iOS, crear una versió per a "
"l'App Store i fer tot el que podeu fer normalment amb Xcode."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:18
msgid ""
"Projects written in C# can be exported to iOS as of Godot 4.2, but support "
"is experimental and :ref:`some limitations apply <doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."
msgstr ""
"Els projectes escrits en C# es poden exportar a iOS a partir de Godot 4.2, "
"però el suport és experimental i :ref:`s'apliquen algunes limitacions "
"<doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:24
msgid ""
"You must export for iOS from a computer running macOS with Xcode installed."
msgstr ""
"Heu d'exportar per a iOS des d'un ordinador amb macOS amb Xcode instal·lat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:25
msgid ""
"Download the Godot export templates. Use the Godot menu: Editor > Manage "
"Export Templates"
msgstr ""
"Descarrega les plantilles d'exportació de Godot. Utilitzeu el menú Godot: "
"Editor > Gestiona les plantilles d'exportació"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:28
msgid "Export a Godot project to Xcode"
msgstr "Exporta un projecte Godot a Xcode"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:30
msgid ""
"In the Godot editor, open the **Export** window from the **Project** menu. "
"When the Export window opens, click **Add..** and select **iOS**."
msgstr ""
"A l'editor Godot, obriu la finestra **Exporta** des del menú **Projecte**. "
"Quan s'obri la finestra Exporta, feu clic a **Afegeix...** i seleccioneu "
"**iOS**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:33
msgid ""
"The **App Store Team ID** and (Bundle) **Identifier** options in the "
"**Application** category are required. Leaving them blank will cause the "
"exporter to throw an error. The bundle ID must be unique."
msgstr ""
"Calen les opcions **Identificador d'equip de l'App Store** i (paquet) "
"**Identificador** a la categoria **Aplicació**. Si els deixes en blanc, "
"l'exportador generarà un error. L'identificador del paquet ha de ser únic."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:0
msgid "If you encounter an error during export similar to"
msgstr "Si trobeu un error durant l'exportació semblant a"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:0
msgid ""
"``JSON text did not start with array or object and option to allow fragments "
"not set``"
msgstr ""
"``El text JSON no va començar amb la matriu o l'objecte i l'opció per "
"permetre que els fragments no es defineixin``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:0
msgid "then it might be due to a malformated **App Store Team ID**!"
msgstr "llavors pot ser degut a un **ID d'equip de l'App Store** malformat!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:0
msgid ""
"The exporter expects a (10 characters long) code like ``ABCDE12XYZ`` and "
"not, e.g., your name as Xcode likes to display in the *Signing & "
"Capabilities* tab."
msgstr ""
"L'exportador espera un codi (de 10 caràcters) com ``ABCDE12XYZ`` i no, per "
"exemple, el vostre nom tal com li agrada Xcode que es mostri a la pestanya "
"*Signing & Capabilities*."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:0
msgid ""
"You can find the code over at `developer.apple.com <https://"
"developer.apple.com/account/resources/certificates/list>`_ next to your name "
"in the top right corner."
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar el codi a `developer.apple.com <https://developer.apple.com/"
"account/resources/certificates/list>`_ al costat del vostre nom a l'extrem "
"superior dret."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:48
