#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:180
msgid ""
"You may need to restart the editor. This is a known bug found in all Godot 4 "
"versions: `GH-66381 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66381>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pot ser que hàgiu de reiniciar l'editor. És un error conegut present a totes "
"les versions del Godot 4: `GH-66381 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"issues/66381>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:187
msgid ""
"If you don't see the changes, reload the scene (close it and open it again)."
msgstr ""
"Si no veieu els canvis, torneu a carregar l'escena (tanqueu-la i torneu-la a "
