#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:215
msgid ""
"Save the script. Now the object will spin clockwise in the editor, but if "
"you run the game, it will spin counter-clockwise."
msgstr ""
"Deseu el guió. Ara l'objecte girarà en sentit horari a l'editor, però si "
