#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:626
msgid ""
"Scripts that extend EditorScript **must** be ``@tool`` scripts to function."
msgstr ""
"Els scripts que estenguin l'EditorScript **han de** ser scripts ``@tool`` "
"per funcionar."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:630
msgid ""
"EditorScripts can only be run from the Godot script editor. If you are using "
"an external editor, use one of the last two approaches to run the script."
msgstr ""
