"utilitzeu un editor extern, utilitzeu un dels dos últims enfocaments per "
"executar l'script."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:635
msgid ""
"C# EditorScripts cannot be run from the script editor as it only supports "
"GDScript. Please refer to the above alternative approaches to run custom C# "
"EditorScripts."
msgstr ""
"C# EditorScripts no es pot executar des de l'editor de scripts, ja que només "
"admet GDScript. Consulteu els enfocaments alternatius anteriors per executar "
"scripts d'editor C# personalitzats."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:639
msgid ""
"Keep in mind C# tool scripts will only appear in the command palette when "
"denoted by the :ref:`GlobalClass <doc_c_sharp_global_classes>` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que els scripts de l'eina C# només apareixeran a la paleta "
"d'ordres quan estiguin indicats per l'atribut :ref:`GlobalClass "
"<doc_c_sharp_global_classes>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:645
msgid ""
"EditorScripts have no undo/redo functionality, so **make sure to save your "
"scene before running one** if the script is designed to modify any data."
msgstr ""
"EditorScripts no tenen cap funció de desfer/refer, així que **assegureu-vos "
"de desar la vostra escena abans d'executar-ne una** si l'script està "
"dissenyat per modificar qualsevol dada."

