#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:50
msgid "Using HDR output in Godot"
msgstr "Ús de sortida HDR al Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:52
msgid ""
"Try out the `HDR output demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"demo-projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ as a first step to using HDR "
"output in Godot. This demo contains examples of the concepts described on "
"this page and will help you ensure that your development environment is "
"correctly configured for HDR output."
msgstr ""
"Proveu el `Projecte de demostració de sortida HDR <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ com a primer "
"pas per utilitzar la sortida HDR a Godot. Aquesta demostració conté exemples "
"dels conceptes descrits en aquesta pàgina i us ajudarà a assegurar-vos que "
"el vostre entorn de desenvolupament estigui configurat correctament per a la "
"sortida HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:58
msgid "HDR output in the Godot editor"
msgstr "Sortida HDR a l'editor del Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Godot editor will use HDR output for its main window when "
"the :ref:`Request HDR Output <class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/"
"hdr/request_hdr_output>` project setting has been enabled. You can tell if "
"your game is running in SDR or HDR output mode based on the text on the "
"right side of game view toolbar: Your game is running in HDR mode when the "
"text \"HDR\" appears next to the window size."
msgstr ""
"L'editor Godot utilitzarà la sortida HDR per a la seva finestra principal "
"quan s'hagi habilitat la configuració del projecte :ref:`Sol·licita la "
"sortida HDR <class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/hdr/"
"request_hdr_output>`. Podeu saber si el vostre joc s'està executant en mode "
"de sortida SDR o HDR segons el text del costat dret de la barra d'eines de "
"visualització del joc: el vostre joc s'està executant en mode HDR quan "
"apareix el text \"HDR\" al costat de la mida de la finestra."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:68
msgid ""
"The number in parentheses next to the \"HDR\" text is the "
"current :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` which is described "
"in the following sections. You can toggle the "
"game's :ref:`Window.hdr_output_requested<class_Window_property_hdr_output_requested>` "
"property in the game window options menu:"
msgstr ""
"El número entre parèntesis al costat del text \"HDR\" és el valor lineal "
"màxim de sortida "
"actual :ref:`<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` que es "
"descriu a les seccions següents. Pots canviar la "
"propietat :ref:`Window.hdr_output_requested<class_Window_property_hdr_output_requested>` "
"del joc al menú d'opcions de la finestra del joc:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:76
msgid "HDR output fundamentals"
msgstr "Fonaments de la sortida HDR"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:78
msgid ""
"Godot uses the `Extended Dynamic Range (EDR) <https://developer.apple.com/"
"videos/play/wwdc2021/10161/>`__ paradigm for HDR output. While SDR output "
"allows color component values between ``0.0`` and ``1.0`` to be displayed, "
"HDR output allows values higher than ``1.0``. The maximum value that can be "
"displayed is provided "
"by :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` "
"and this method is valid when using SDR or HDR."
msgstr ""
"Godot utilitza el paradigma `Extended Dynamic Range (EDR) <https://"
"developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2021/10161/>`__ per a la sortida HDR. "
"Tot i que la sortida SDR permet que es mostrin valors de components de color "
"entre ``0,0`` i ``1,0``, la sortida HDR permet valors superiors a ``1,0``. "
"El valor màxim que es pot mostrar el "
"proporciona :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` "
"i aquest mètode és vàlid quan s'utilitza SDR o HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:89
msgid ""
"These graphs are presented as SDR images that do not contain any HDR color. "
"To compensate for this limitation, the grayscale bars along each axis have a "
"glow effect applied to represent values that are outside of the SDR range. "
"The \"output max value\" in this graph represents the maximum linear color "
"component value returned "
"by :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."
msgstr ""
"Aquests gràfics es presenten com a imatges SDR que no contenen cap color "
"HDR. Per compensar aquesta limitació, les barres d'escala de grisos al llarg "
"de cada eix tenen un efecte de resplendor aplicat per representar valors que "
"es troben fora del rang SDR. El \"valor màxim de sortida\" d'aquest gràfic "
"representa el valor màxim del component de color lineal retornat "
"per :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:96
msgid "Designing for HDR output"
msgstr "Disseny per a la sortida HDR"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:98
msgid ""
"There are two primary approaches to make the most of HDR output: using "
"the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` and using "
"tonemapping."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha dos enfocaments principals per aprofitar al màxim la sortida HDR: "
"utilitzar el valor lineal màxim de la sortida :ref:`output "
"max<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` i utilitzar el mapa de "
"tons."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:102
msgid ""
"While both approaches can be used in the same project, tonemapping should be "
"used to produce HDR output from a :ref:`Viewport<class_Viewport>` that uses "
"lighting that exceeds the capabilities of an SDR screen, indirect lighting, "
"global illumination, emissive materials, post-processing effects, or any "
"other techniques that make use of the colors values in the scene."
msgstr ""
"Tot i que tots dos enfocaments es poden utilitzar en el mateix projecte, el "
"mapa de tons s'ha d'utilitzar per produir una sortida HDR a partir "
"d'un :ref:`Viewport<class_Viewport>` que utilitza una il·luminació que "
"supera les capacitats d'una pantalla SDR, il·luminació indirecta, "
"il·luminació global, materials emissius, efectes de postprocessament o "
"qualsevol altra tècnica que faci ús dels valors dels colors a l'escena."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:107
msgid ""
"The :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` should only be used "
"to present colors directly to the screen without tonemapping and without "
"influencing lighting, post-processing effects, or surrounding color. This "
"makes the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` well suited "
"for :ref:`CanvasItems<class_CanvasItem>` or unshaded materials in a scene "
"that has no lighting or basic lighting that otherwise does not exceed the "
"capabilities of an SDR screen."
msgstr ""
"El :ref:`valor lineal màxim de "
"sortida<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` només s'ha "
"d'utilitzar per presentar colors directament a la pantalla sense mapeig de "
"tons i sense influir en la il·luminació, els efectes de postprocessament o "
"el color circumdant. Això fa que el :ref:`valor lineal màxim de "
"sortida<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` sigui molt adequat "
"per a :ref:`CanvasItems<class_CanvasItem>` o materials sense ombres en una "
"escena que no tingui il·luminació o il·luminació bàsica que, d'altra manera, "
"no superi les capacitats d'una pantalla SDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:114
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Viewport.own_world_3d<class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>` "
"property can be used to separate which :ref:`Viewports<class_Viewport>` are "
"affected by tonemapping and other :ref:`class_WorldEnvironment` effects."
msgstr ""
"La "
"propietat :ref:`Viewport.own_world_3d<class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>` "
"es pot utilitzar per separar quins :ref:`Viewports<class_Viewport>` es veuen "
"afectats pel mapa de tons i altres efectes :ref:`class_WorldEnvironment`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:119
msgid "Using output max linear value"
msgstr "Utilitzant el valor lineal màxim de sortida"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:121
msgid ""
"In a traditional SDR-only game, the brightest presentation of a color is "
"limited by either the red, green, or blue component of the color reaching a "
"maximum of ``1.0``. When using a modern HDR screen this limitation no longer "
"applies and color components above ``1.0`` can be accurately presented. "
"Godot provides the maximum color component value that can be presented by "
"the screen through the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. This value can be "
"used in both SDR and HDR, which makes it easy to build your game for both "
"output modes without needing to change behavior based on whether or not HDR "
"output is enabled."
msgstr ""
"En un joc tradicional només de SDR, la presentació més brillant d'un color "
"està limitada pel component vermell, verd o blau del color que arriba a un "
"màxim de ``1,0``. Quan s'utilitza una pantalla HDR moderna, aquesta "
"limitació ja no s'aplica i els components de color superiors a ``1.0`` es "
"poden presentar amb precisió. Godot proporciona el valor màxim del component "
"de color que pot presentar la pantalla mitjançant el valor lineal màxim de "
"sortida :ref:`<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. Aquest "
"valor es pot utilitzar tant en SDR com en HDR, cosa que facilita la creació "
"del vostre joc per als dos modes de sortida sense necessitat de canviar el "
"comportament en funció de si la sortida HDR està habilitada o no."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:129
msgid ""
"The :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` may change often as "
"the player adjusts their device brightness, enables or disables HDR output "
"on their device, or moves the game window between screens, so it's important "
"to retrieve this value every frame or use the :ref:`output max linear value "
"changed<class_Window_signal_output_max_linear_value_changed>` signal. The "
"value will always equal ``1.0`` in SDR mode and may also equal ``1.0`` when "
"HDR output is enabled and the player has adjusted their screen to its "
"maximum brightness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:136
msgid ""
"It is best to use this :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` with \"highlights\" "
"and special effects that are either brief or involve a small portion of the "
"screen; if the majority of the screen is presented at this maximum "
"brightness for more than a short time, it will cause the game to appear "
"uncomfortably bright, as if the game is ignoring the device brightness "
"setting. You may also find that some effects look best when limited to a "
"maximum linear value that is greater than ``1.0``, but less than "
"the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. You can read more "
"about how it is sometimes desirable to limit the maximum HDR value in the "
"`HDR and User Interfaces <https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2025/09/"
"hdr-and-user-interfaces.html>`__ post of the Android Developers Blog."
msgstr ""
"El millor és utilitzar aquest :ref:`valor lineal màxim de "
"sortida<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` amb \"destacats\" "
"i efectes especials que siguin breus o impliquen una petita part de la "
"pantalla; si la majoria de la pantalla es presenta amb aquesta brillantor "
"màxima durant més d'un temps, el joc semblarà incòmode, com si el joc "
"ignorés la configuració de la brillantor del dispositiu. També podeu trobar "
"que alguns efectes es veuen millor quan estan limitats a un valor lineal "
"màxim superior a ``1.0``, però inferior al :ref:`valor lineal màxim de "
"sortida<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. Podeu llegir més "
"sobre com és convenient limitar el valor màxim de HDR a la publicació `HDR i "
"interfícies d'usuari <https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2025/09/hdr-"
"and-user-interfaces.html>`__ del bloc de desenvolupadors d'Android."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:147
