msgid "Array"
msgstr "Matriu"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:262
msgid ""
"``\"Hi, {name} v{version}!\".format([[\"version\",\"3.0\"], [\"name\","
"\"Godette\"]])``"
msgstr ""
"``\"Hola, {name} v{version}!\".format([[\"version\",\"3.0\"], [\"name\","
"\"Godette\"]])``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:264
msgid "``\"Hi, {0} v{1}!\".format([\"Godette\",\"3.0\"])``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, {0} v{1}!\".format([\"Godette\",\"3.0\"])``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:266
msgid "``\"Hi, {name} v{0}!\".format([\"3.0\", [\"name\",\"Godette\"]])``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, {name} v{0}!\".format([\"3.0\", [\"name\",\"Godette\"]])``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:268
msgid "no index"
msgstr "sense índex"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:268
msgid "``\"Hi, {} v{}!\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"{}\")``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, {} v{}!\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"{}\")``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:271
msgid ""
"Placeholders can also be customized when using ``String.format``, here's "
"some examples of that functionality."
msgstr ""
"Els marcadors de posició també es poden personalitzar quan s'utilitza "
"``String.format``, aquí teniu alguns exemples d'aquesta funcionalitat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:278
msgid "Infix (default)"
msgstr "Infix (per defecte)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:278
msgid "``\"Hi, {0} v{1}\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"{_}\")``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, {0} v{1}\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"{_}\")``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:278
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:280
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:282
msgid "Hi, Godette v3.0"
msgstr "Hola, Godette v3.0"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:280
msgid "Postfix"
msgstr "Postfix"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:280
msgid "``\"Hi, 0% v1%\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"_%\")``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, 0% v1%\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"_%\")``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:282
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Prefix"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:282
msgid "``\"Hi, %0 v%1\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"%_\")``"
msgstr "``\"Hola, %0 v%1\".format([\"Godette\", \"3.0\"], \"%_\")``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:285
msgid ""
"Combining both the ``String.format`` method and the ``%`` operator could be "
"useful, as ``String.format`` does not have a way to manipulate the "
"representation of numbers."
msgstr ""
"La combinació tant del mètode ``String.format`` com de l'operador ``%`` "
"podria ser útil, ja que ``String.format`` no té cap manera de manipular la "
"representació de nombres."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:291
msgid ""
"``\"Hi, {0} v{version}\".format({0:\"Godette\", \"version\":\"%0.2f\" % "
"3.114})``"
msgstr ""
"``\"Hola, {0} v{version}\".format({0:\"Godette\", \"version\":\"%0.2f\" % "
"3.114})``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:291
msgid "Hi, Godette v3.11"
msgstr "Hola, Godette v3.11"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:295
msgid "String concatenation"
msgstr "Concatenació de cadenes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:297
msgid ""
"You can also combine strings by *concatenating* them together, using the "
"``+`` operator."
msgstr ""
"També podeu combinar cadenes *concatenant-les* junts, utilitzant l'operador "
"``+``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:311
msgid ""
"When using string concatenation, values that are not strings must be "
"converted using the ``str()`` function. There is no way to specify the "
"string format of converted values."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'utilitza la concatenació de cadenes, els valors que no són cadenes "
"s'han de convertir mitjançant la funció ``str()``. No hi ha manera "
"d'especificar el format de cadena dels valors convertits."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:324
msgid ""
"Because of these limitations, format strings or the ``format()`` method are "
"often a better choice. In many cases, string concatenation is also less "
"readable."
msgstr ""
"A causa d'aquestes limitacions, les cadenes de format o el mètode "
"``format()`` solen ser una millor opció. En molts casos, la concatenació de "
"cadenes també és menys llegible."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:329
msgid ""
"In Godot's C++ code, GDScript format strings can be accessed using the "
"``vformat()`` helper function in the :ref:`Variant<class_Variant>` header."
msgstr ""
"Al codi C++ de Godot, es pot accedir a les cadenes de format GDScript "
"mitjançant la funció d'ajuda ``vformat()`` a la "
"capçalera :ref:`Variant<class_Variant>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:6
msgid "C#/.NET"
msgstr "C#/.NET"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"C# is a high-level programming language developed by Microsoft. Godot "
"supports C# as an option for a scripting language, alongside Godot's "
"own :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>`."
msgstr ""
"C# és un llenguatge de programació d'alt nivell desenvolupat per Microsoft. "
"Godot admet C# com a opció per a un llenguatge de script, juntament amb el "
"propi :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>` de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"The standard Godot executable does not contain C# support out of the box. "
"Instead, to enable C# support for your project you need to `download a .NET "
"version <https://godotengine.org/download/>`_ of the editor from the Godot "
"website."
msgstr ""
"L'executable estàndard de Godot no conté suport C# fora de la caixa. En lloc "
"d'això, per habilitar el suport C# per al vostre projecte, heu de "
"`descarregar una versió .NET <https://godotengine.org/download/>`_ de "
"l'editor des del lloc web de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:26
msgid "Godot API for C#"
msgstr "API Godot per a C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"As a general purpose game engine Godot offers some high-level features as a "
"part of its API. Articles below explain how these features integrate into C# "
"and how C# API may be different from GDScript."
msgstr ""
"Com a motor de jocs de propòsit general, Godot ofereix algunes funcions "
"d'alt nivell com a part de la seva API. Els articles següents expliquen com "
"s'integren aquestes funcions a C# i com l'API de C# pot ser diferent de "
"GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:46
msgid "C# platform support"
msgstr "Suport de plataformes per a C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:50
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_system_requirements` for hardware and software version "
"requirements for the Godot engine."
msgstr ""
"Vegeu :ref:`doc_system_requirements` per als requisits de versió de "
"maquinari i programari del motor Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"Since C# projects use the .NET runtime, also check the system requirements "
"for the version of .NET that you'll be using. See `supported OS <https://"
"github.com/dotnet/core/tree/main/release-notes#supported-os>`_."
msgstr ""
"Com que els projectes C# utilitzen el temps d'execució .NET, també comproveu "
"els requisits del sistema per a la versió de .NET que fareu servir. Vegeu "
"`SO admès <https://github.com/dotnet/core/tree/main/release-notes#supported-"
"os>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:59
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.2, projects written in C# support all desktop platforms "
"(Windows, Linux, and macOS), as well as Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"Des de Godot 4.2, els projectes escrits en C# admeten totes les plataformes "
"d'escriptori (Windows, Linux i macOS), així com Android i iOS."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:62
msgid "Android support is currently experimental."
msgstr "El suport per a Android encara és experimental."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:64
msgid "iOS support is currently experimental and has a few limitations."
msgstr "El suport d'iOS és actualment experimental i té algunes limitacions."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"The official export templates for the iOS simulator only supports the "
"``x64`` architecture."
msgstr ""
"Les plantilles d'exportació oficials per al simulador d'iOS només admeten "
"l'arquitectura ``x64``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:68
msgid "Exporting to iOS can only be done from a macOS device."
msgstr "L'exportació a iOS només es pot fer des d'un dispositiu macOS."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/index.rst:70
msgid ""
"Currently, projects written in C# cannot be exported to the web platform. To "
"use C# on that platform, consider Godot 3 instead."
msgstr ""
"Actualment, els projectes escrits en C# no es poden exportar a la plataforma "
"web. Per utilitzar C# en aquesta plataforma, considereu Godot 3."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:2
msgid "C# basics"
msgstr "Conceptes bàsics de C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:7
msgid ""
"This page provides a brief introduction to C#, both what it is and how to "
"use it in Godot. Afterwards, you may want to look at :ref:`how to use "
"specific features <doc_c_sharp_features>`, read about the :ref:`differences "
"between the C# and the GDScript API <doc_c_sharp_differences>`, and "
"(re)visit the :ref:`Scripting section <doc_scripting>` of the step-by-step "
"tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:14
msgid ""
"C# is a high-level programming language developed by Microsoft. In Godot, it "
"is implemented with the modern .NET runtime."
msgstr ""
"C# és un llenguatge de programació d'alt nivell desenvolupat per Microsoft. "
"A Godot, s'implementa amb el temps d'execució .NET modern."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:19
msgid ""
"Projects written in C# using Godot 4 currently cannot be exported to the web "
"platform. To use C# on the web platform, consider Godot 3 instead. Android "
"and iOS platform support is available as of Godot 4.2, but is experimental "
"and :ref:`some limitations apply <doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."
msgstr ""
"Els projectes escrits en C# amb Godot 4 actualment no es poden exportar a la "
"plataforma web. Per utilitzar C# a la plataforma web, considereu Godot 3. El "
"suport de la plataforma Android i iOS està disponible a partir de Godot 4.2, "
"però és experimental i :ref:`s'apliquen algunes limitacions "
"<doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:26
msgid ""
"This is **not** a full-scale tutorial on the C# language as a whole. If you "
"aren't already familiar with its syntax or features, see the `Microsoft C# "
"guide <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/index>`_ or look for a "
"suitable introduction elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Aquest **no** és un tutorial a gran escala sobre el llenguatge C# en "
"conjunt. Si encara no esteu familiaritzat amb la seva sintaxi o "
"característiques, consulteu la `Guia de Microsoft C# <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/index>`_ o cerqueu una introducció "
"adequada en un altre lloc."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:36
msgid ""
"Godot bundles the parts of .NET needed to run already-compiled games. "
"However, Godot does not bundle the tools required to build and compile "
"games, such as MSBuild and the C# compiler. These are included in the .NET "
"SDK, and need to be installed separately."
msgstr ""
"Godot agrupa les parts de .NET necessàries per executar jocs ja compilats. "
"Tanmateix, Godot no inclou les eines necessàries per crear i compilar jocs, "
"com ara MSBuild i el compilador C#. S'inclouen al .NET SDK i s'han "
"d'instal·lar per separat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:41
msgid ""
"In summary, you must have installed the .NET SDK **and** the .NET-enabled "
"version of Godot."
msgstr ""
"En resum, heu d'haver instal·lat l'SDK .NET **i** la versió de Godot "
"habilitada per .NET."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:44
msgid ""
"Download and install the latest stable version of the SDK from the `.NET "
"download page <https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download>`__. Godot 4.5 "
"requires .NET 8 or later, but exporting to Android requires .NET 9 or later."
msgstr ""
"Baixeu i instal·leu la darrera versió estable de l'SDK des de la pàgina de "
"descàrrega `.NET <https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download>`__. Godot 4.5 "
"requereix .NET 8 o posterior, però per exportar a Android requereix .NET 9 o "
"posterior."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:50
msgid ""
"Be sure to install the 64-bit version of the SDK(s) if you are using the 64-"
"bit version of Godot."
msgstr ""
"Assegureu-vos d'instal·lar la versió de 64 bits dels SDK si feu servir la "
"versió de 64 bits de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:53
msgid ""
"If you are building Godot from source, make sure to follow the steps to "
"enable .NET support in your build as outlined in "
"the :ref:`doc_compiling_with_dotnet` page."
msgstr ""
"Si esteu creant Godot des de la font, assegureu-vos de seguir els passos per "
"habilitar el suport .NET a la vostra compilació, tal com s'indica a la "
"pàgina :ref:`doc_compiling_with_dotnet`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:60
msgid "Configuring an external editor"
msgstr "Configuració d'un editor extern"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:62
msgid ""
"C# support in Godot's built-in script editor is minimal. Consider using an "
"external IDE or editor, such as  `Visual Studio Code <https://"
"code.visualstudio.com/>`__ or `Visual Studio <https://"
"visualstudio.microsoft.com/>`__. These provide autocompletion, debugging, "
"and other useful features for C#. To select an external editor in Godot, "
"click on **Editor → Editor Settings** and scroll down to **Dotnet**. Under "
"**Dotnet**, click on **Editor**, and select your external editor of choice. "
"Godot currently supports the following external editors:"
msgstr ""
"El suport de C# a l'editor de scripts integrat de Godot és mínim. Penseu en "
"utilitzar un IDE o editor extern, com ara `Visual Studio Code <https://"
"code.visualstudio.com/>`__ o `Visual Studio <https://"
"visualstudio.microsoft.com/>`__. Aquests ofereixen l'autocompleció, la "
"depuració i altres funcions útils per a C#. Per seleccionar un editor extern "
"a Godot, feu clic a **Editor → Configuració de l'editor** i desplaceu-vos "
"cap avall fins a **Dotnet**. A **Dotnet**, feu clic a **Editor** i "
"seleccioneu l'editor extern que vulgueu. Actualment Godot admet els següents "
"editors externs:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:71
msgid "Visual Studio 2022"
msgstr "Visual Studio 2022"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:73
msgid "MonoDevelop"
msgstr "MonoDevelop"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:74
msgid "Visual Studio for Mac"
msgstr "Visual Studio per a Mac"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:77
msgid "See the following sections for how to configure an external editor:"
msgstr ""
"Consulteu les seccions següents per saber com configurar un editor extern:"

