#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:173
msgid ""
"If you see an error like \"Unable to find package Godot.NET.Sdk\", your "
"NuGet configuration may be incorrect and need to be fixed."
msgstr ""
"Si veieu un error com \"No es pot trobar el paquet Godot.NET.Sdk\", pot ser "
"que la vostra configuració de NuGet sigui incorrecta i s'hagi de solucionar."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:176
msgid ""
"A simple way to fix the NuGet configuration file is to regenerate it. In a "
"file explorer window, go to ``%AppData%\\NuGet``. Rename or delete the "
"``NuGet.Config`` file. When you build your Godot project again, the file "
"will be automatically created with default values."
msgstr ""
"Una manera senzilla d'arreglar el fitxer de configuració de NuGet és "
"regenerar-lo. En una finestra de l'explorador de fitxers, aneu a ``%AppData%"
"\\NuGet``. Canvieu el nom o suprimiu el fitxer ``NuGet.Config``. Quan torneu "
"a crear el vostre projecte Godot, el fitxer es crearà automàticament amb els "
"valors predeterminats."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:181
msgid ""
"To debug your C# scripts using Visual Studio, open the .sln file that is "
"generated after opening the first C# script in the editor. In the **Debug** "
"menu, go to the **Debug Properties** menu item for your project. Click the "
"**Create a new profile** button and choose **Executable**. In the "
"**Executable** field, browse to the path of the C# version of the Godot "
"editor, or type ``%GODOT4%`` if you have created an environment variable for "
"the Godot executable path. It must be the path to the main Godot executable, "
"not the 'console' version. For the **Working Directory**, type a single "
"period, ``.``, meaning the current directory. Also check the **Enable native "
"code debugging** checkbox. You may now close this window, click downward "
"arrow on the debug profile dropdown, and select your new launch profile. Hit "
"the green start button, and your game will begin playing in debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Per depurar els vostres scripts C# amb Visual Studio, obriu el fitxer .sln "
"que es genera després d'obrir el primer script C# a l'editor. Al menú "
"**Depuració**, aneu a l'element de menú **Propietats de depuració** del "
"vostre projecte. Feu clic al botó **Crea un perfil nou** i trieu "
"**Executable**. Al camp **Executable**, busqueu la ruta de la versió C# de "
"l'editor Godot o escriviu ``%GODOT4%`` si heu creat una variable d'entorn "
"per a la ruta executable de Godot. Ha de ser el camí a l'executable "
"principal de Godot, no la versió de 'consola'. Per al **Directori de "
"treball**, escriviu un sol punt, ``.``, és a dir, el directori actual. "
"Marqueu també la casella de selecció **Activa la depuració de codi natiu**. "
"Ara podeu tancar aquesta finestra, fer clic a la fletxa cap avall al menú "
"desplegable del perfil de depuració i seleccionar el vostre nou perfil "
"d'inici. Premeu el botó verd d'inici i el vostre joc començarà a jugar en "
"mode de depuració."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:195
msgid "Creating a C# script"
msgstr "Creació d'un script C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:197
msgid ""
"After you successfully set up C# for Godot, you should see the following "
"option when selecting **Attach Script** in the context menu of a node in "
"your scene:"
msgstr ""
"Després de configurar correctament C# per a Godot, hauríeu de veure l'opció "
"següent quan seleccioneu **Adjuntar script** al menú contextual d'un node de "
"la vostra escena:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:202
msgid ""
"Note that while some specifics change, most concepts work the same when "
"using C# for scripting. If you're new to Godot, you may want to follow the "
"tutorials on :ref:`doc_scripting` at this point. While some documentation "
"pages still lack C# examples, most notions can be transferred from GDScript."
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que, tot i que canvien alguns aspectes específics, la "
"majoria dels conceptes funcionen igual quan s'utilitza C# per a scripts. Si "
"sou nou a Godot, potser voldreu seguir els tutorials "
"sobre :ref:`doc_scripting` en aquest moment. Tot i que algunes pàgines de "
"documentació encara no tenen exemples C#, la majoria de nocions es poden "
"transferir des de GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:209
msgid "Project setup and workflow"
msgstr "Configuració del projecte i flux de treball"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:211
msgid ""
"When you create the first C# script, Godot initializes the C# project files "
"for your Godot project. This includes generating a C# solution (``.sln``) "
"and a project file (``.csproj``), as well as some utility files and folders "
"(``.godot/mono``). All of these but ``.godot/mono`` are important and should "
"be committed to your version control system. Everything under ``.godot`` can "
"be safely added to the ignore list of your VCS. When troubleshooting, it can "
"sometimes help to delete the ``.godot/mono`` folder and let it regenerate."
msgstr ""
"Quan creeu el primer script C#, Godot inicialitza els fitxers del projecte "
"C# per al vostre projecte Godot. Això inclou generar una solució C# "
"(``.sln``) i un fitxer de projecte (``.csproj``), així com alguns fitxers i "
"carpetes d'utilitat (``.godot/mono``). Tot això, excepte ``.godot/mono``, "
"són importants i haurien d'estar compromesos amb el vostre sistema de "
"control de versions. Tot el que hi ha sota ``.godot`` es pot afegir amb "
"seguretat a la llista d'ignorar del vostre VCS. Quan es resolgui problemes, "
"de vegades pot ajudar a eliminar la carpeta ``.godot/mono`` i deixar que es "
"regeneri."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:224
msgid ""
"Here's a blank C# script with some comments to demonstrate how it works."
msgstr ""
"Aquí teniu un script C# en blanc amb alguns comentaris per demostrar com "
"funciona."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:250
msgid ""
"As you can see, functions normally in global scope in GDScript like Godot's "
"``print`` function are available in the ``GD`` static class which is part of "
"the ``Godot`` namespace. For a full list of methods in the ``GD`` class, see "
"the class reference pages for :ref:`@GDScript <class_@gdscript>` "
"and :ref:`@GlobalScope <class_@globalscope>`."
msgstr ""
"Com podeu veure, les funcions que normalment tenen un àmbit global a "
"GDScript com la funció ``print`` de Godot estan disponibles a la classe "
"estàtica ``GD`` que forma part de l'espai de noms ``Godot``. Per obtenir una "
"llista completa de mètodes a la classe ``GD``, consulteu les pàgines de "
"referència de classe per a :ref:`@GDScript <class_@gdscript>` "
"i :ref:`@GlobalScope <class_@globalscope>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:258
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the class you wish to attach to your node should have the "
"same name as the ``.cs`` file. Otherwise, you will get the following error:"
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que la classe que voleu adjuntar al vostre node hauria de "
"tenir el mateix nom que el fitxer ``.cs``. En cas contrari, obtindreu el "
"següent error:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:261
msgid "*\"Cannot find class XXX for script res://XXX.cs\"*"
msgstr "*\"No es pot trobar la classe XXX per a l'script res://XXX.cs\"*"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:266
msgid "General differences between C# and GDScript"
msgstr "Diferències generals entre C# i GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:268
msgid ""
"The C# API uses ``PascalCase`` instead of ``snake_case`` in GDScript/C++. "
"Where possible, fields and getters/setters have been converted to "
"properties. In general, the C# Godot API strives to be as idiomatic as is "
"reasonably possible."
msgstr ""
"L'API de C# utilitza ``PascalCase`` en lloc de ``snake_case`` a GDScript/C+"
"+. Quan és possible, els camps i els getters/setters s'han convertit en "
"propietats. En general, l'API C# Godot s'esforça per ser tan idiomàtica com "
"sigui raonablement possible."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:272
msgid "For more information, see the :ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences` page."
msgstr ""
"Per obtenir més informació, consulteu la "
"pàgina :ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:276
msgid ""
"You need to (re)build the project assemblies whenever you want to see new "
"exported variables or signals in the editor. This build can be manually "
"triggered by clicking the **Build** button in the top right corner of the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Heu de (re)construir els conjunts del projecte sempre que vulgueu veure "
"noves variables o senyals exportats a l'editor. Aquesta compilació es pot "
"activar manualment fent clic al botó **Build** a l'extrem superior dret de "
"l'editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:283
msgid ""
"You will also need to rebuild the project assemblies to apply changes in "
"\"tool\" scripts."
msgstr ""
"També haureu de reconstruir els conjunts del projecte per aplicar canvis als "
"scripts d'\"eina\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:287
msgid "Current gotchas and known issues"
msgstr "Problemes actuals i problemes coneguts"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:289
msgid ""
"As C# support is quite new in Godot, there are some growing pains and things "
"that need to be ironed out. Below is a list of the most important issues you "
"should be aware of when diving into C# in Godot, but if in doubt, also take "
"a look over the official `issue tracker for .NET issues <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/labels/topic%3Adotnet>`_."
msgstr ""
"Com que el suport de C# és força nou a Godot, hi ha alguns problemes de "
"creixement i coses que s'han de resoldre. A continuació es mostra una llista "
"dels problemes més importants que hauríeu de tenir en compte quan us "
"introduïu en C# a Godot, però si teniu dubtes, també feu una ullada al "
"`seguidor de problemes oficial per a problemes de .NET <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/labels/topic%3Adotnet>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:295
msgid ""
"Writing editor plugins is possible, but it is currently quite convoluted."
msgstr ""
"És possible escriure connectors d'editor, però actualment és força complicat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:296
msgid ""
"State is currently not saved and restored when hot-reloading, with the "
"exception of exported variables."
msgstr ""
"Actualment, l'estat no es desa i es restaura quan es recarrega en calent, a "
"excepció de les variables exportades."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:298
msgid ""
"Attached C# scripts should refer to a class that has a class name that "
"matches the file name."
msgstr ""
"Els scripts C# adjunts haurien de fer referència a una classe que tingui un "
"nom de classe que coincideixi amb el nom del fitxer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:300
msgid ""
"There are some methods such as ``Get()``/``Set()``, ``Call()``/"
"``CallDeferred()`` and signal connection method ``Connect()`` that rely on "
"Godot's ``snake_case`` API naming conventions. So when using e.g. "
"``CallDeferred(\"AddChild\")``, ``AddChild`` will not work because the API "
"is expecting the original ``snake_case`` version ``add_child``. However, you "
"can use any custom properties or methods without this limitation. Prefer "
"using the exposed ``StringName`` in the ``PropertyName``, ``MethodName`` and "
"``SignalName`` to avoid extra ``StringName`` allocations and worrying about "
"snake_case naming."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha alguns mètodes com ``Get()``/``Set()``, ``Call()``/``CallDeferred()`` "
"i el mètode de connexió de senyal ``Connect()`` que es basen en les "
"convencions de denominació de l'API ``snake_case`` de Godot. Així, quan "
"s'utilitza, p. ``CallDeferred(\"AddChild\")``, ``AddChild`` no funcionarà "
"perquè l'API espera la versió original de ``snake_case`` ``add_child``. "
"Tanmateix, podeu utilitzar qualsevol propietat o mètode personalitzat sense "
"aquesta limitació. Preferiu utilitzar el ``StringName`` exposat a "
"``PropertyName``, ``MethodName`` i ``SignalName`` per evitar assignacions "
"addicionals de ``StringName`` i preocupar-vos per la denominació de "
"snake_case."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:310
msgid ""
"As of Godot 4.0, exporting .NET projects is supported for desktop platforms "
"(Linux, Windows and macOS). Other platforms will gain support in future 4.x "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"A partir de Godot 4.0, l'exportació de projectes .NET és compatible amb "
"plataformes d'escriptori (Linux, Windows i macOS). Altres plataformes "
"tindran suport en futures versions 4.x."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:315
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "Comunitat"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:317
msgid ""
"You might encounter the following error when trying to modify some values in "
"Godot objects, e.g. when trying to change the X coordinate of a ``Node2D``:"
msgstr ""
"És possible que trobeu el següent error quan intenteu modificar alguns "
"valors en objectes Godot, p. quan intenteu canviar la coordenada X d'un "
"\"Node2D\":"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:333
msgid ""
"This is perfectly normal. Structs (in this example, a ``Vector2``) in C# are "
"copied on assignment, meaning that when you retrieve such an object from a "
"property or an indexer, you get a copy of it, not the object itself. "
"Modifying said copy without reassigning it afterwards won't achieve anything."
msgstr ""
"Això és perfectament normal. Les estructures (en aquest exemple, un "
"``Vector2``) en C# es copien a l'assignació, el que significa que quan "
"recupereu un objecte d'aquest tipus d'una propietat o d'un indexador, "
"obteniu una còpia d'aquest, no l'objecte en si. Modificar aquesta còpia "
"sense reassignar-la després no aconseguirà res."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:338
msgid ""
"The workaround is simple: retrieve the entire struct, modify the value you "
"want to modify, and reassign the property."
msgstr ""
"La solució és senzilla: recupereu l'estructura sencera, modifiqueu el valor "
"que voleu modificar i reassigneu la propietat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:347
msgid ""
"Since C# 10, it is also possible to use `with expressions <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/operators/with-"
"expression>`_ on structs, allowing you to do the same thing in a single line."
msgstr ""
"Des de C# 10, també és possible utilitzar `amb expressions <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/operators/with-"
"expression>`_ a les estructures, la qual cosa us permet fer el mateix en una "
"sola línia."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:354
msgid ""
"You can read more about this error on the `C# language reference <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/compiler-messages/"
"cs1612>`_."
msgstr ""
"Podeu llegir més sobre aquest error a la `Referència del llenguatge C# "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/compiler-"
"messages/cs1612>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:357
msgid "Performance of C# in Godot"
msgstr "Rendiment de C# a Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:361
msgid ""
"For a performance comparison of the languages Godot supports, "
"see :ref:`doc_faq_which_programming_language_is_fastest`."
msgstr ""
"Per a una comparació del rendiment dels idiomes que admet Godot, "
"vegeu :ref:`doc_faq_which_programming_language_is_fastest`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:364
msgid ""
"Most properties of Godot C# objects that are based on ``GodotObject`` (e.g. "
"any ``Node`` like ``Control`` or ``Node3D`` like ``Camera3D``) require "
"native (interop) calls as they talk to Godot's C++ core. Consider assigning "
"values of such properties into a local variable if you need to modify or "
"read them multiple times at a single code location:"
msgstr ""
"La majoria de propietats dels objectes Godot C# que es basen en "
"``GodotObject`` (per exemple, qualsevol ``Node`` com ``Control`` o "
"``Node3D`` com ``Camera3D``) requereixen trucades natives "
"(interoperabilitat) ja que parlen amb el nucli C++ de Godot. Penseu en "
"assignar valors d'aquestes propietats a una variable local si necessiteu "
"modificar-les o llegir-les diverses vegades en una única ubicació de codi:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:400
msgid ""
"Passing raw arrays (such as ``byte[]``) or ``string`` to Godot's C# API "
"requires marshalling which is comparatively pricey."
msgstr ""
"Passar matrius en brut (com ara ``byte[]``) o ``cadena`` a l'API C# de Godot "
"requereix un marshalling que és relativament car."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:403
msgid ""
"The implicit conversion from ``string`` to ``NodePath`` or ``StringName`` "
"incur both the native interop and marshalling costs as the ``string`` has to "
"be marshalled and passed to the respective native constructor."
msgstr ""
"La conversió implícita de ``string`` a ``NodePath`` o ``StringName`` "
"comporta tant la interoperació nativa com els costos de classificació, ja "
"que la ``cadena`` s'ha de classificar i passar al constructor natiu "
"respectiu."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:407
msgid "Using NuGet packages in Godot"
msgstr "Utilitzant paquets NuGet a Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:409
msgid ""
"`NuGet <https://www.nuget.org/>`_ packages can be installed and used with "
"Godot, as with any C# project. Many IDEs are able to add packages directly. "
"They can also be added manually by adding the package reference in the "
"``.csproj`` file located in the project root:"
msgstr ""
"Els paquets `NuGet <https://www.nuget.org/>`_ es poden instal·lar i "
"utilitzar amb Godot, com amb qualsevol projecte C#. Molts IDE són capaços "
"d'afegir paquets directament. També es poden afegir manualment afegint la "
"referència del paquet al fitxer ``.csproj`` situat a l'arrel del projecte:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:423
msgid ""
"Godot automatically downloads and sets up newly added NuGet packages the "
"next time it builds the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot baixa i configura automàticament els paquets NuGet recentment afegits "
"la propera vegada que construeixi el projecte."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:427
msgid "Profiling your C# code"
msgstr "Perfil del vostre codi C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:429
msgid ""
"The following tools may be used for performance and memory profiling of your "
"managed code:"
msgstr ""
"Les eines següents es poden utilitzar per al rendiment i el perfil de "
"memòria del vostre codi gestionat:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:431
msgid "JetBrains Rider with dotTrace/dotMemory plugin."
msgstr "JetBrains Rider amb el connector dotTrace/dotMemory."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:432
msgid "Standalone JetBrains dotTrace/dotMemory."
msgstr "JetBrains autònom dotTrace/dotMemory."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:433
msgid "Visual Studio."
msgstr "Visual Studio."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:435
msgid ""
"Profiling managed and unmanaged code at once is possible with both JetBrains "
"tools and Visual Studio, but limited to Windows."
msgstr ""
"És possible crear perfils de codi gestionat i no gestionat alhora amb les "
"eines de JetBrains i Visual Studio, però limitat a Windows."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:4
msgid "C# language features"
msgstr "Característiques"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of the commonly used features of both C# and "
"Godot and how they are used together."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta pàgina ofereix una visió general de les funcions d'ús habitual tant "
"de C# com de Godot i com s'utilitzen junts."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:12
msgid "Type conversion and casting"
msgstr "Conversió de tipus i fosa"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:14
msgid ""
"C# is a statically typed language. Therefore, you can't do the following:"
msgstr ""
"C# és un llenguatge escrit de manera estàtica. Per tant, no podeu fer el "
"següent:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:21
msgid ""
"The method ``GetNode()`` returns a ``Node`` instance. You must explicitly "
"convert it to the desired derived type, ``Sprite2D`` in this case."
msgstr ""
"El mètode ``GetNode()`` retorna una instància ``Node``. Heu de convertir-lo "
"explícitament al tipus derivat desitjat, ``Sprite2D`` en aquest cas."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:24
msgid "For this, you have various options in C#."
msgstr "Per a això, teniu diverses opcions en C#."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:26
msgid "**Casting and Type Checking**"
msgstr "**Emissió i comprovació de tipus**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:28
msgid ""
"Throws ``InvalidCastException`` if the returned node cannot be cast to "
"Sprite2D. You would use it instead of the ``as`` operator if you are pretty "
"sure it won't fail."
msgstr ""
"Llança ``InvalidCastException`` si el node retornat no es pot emetre a "
"Sprite2D. Ho faríeu servir en lloc de l'operador ``as`` si esteu bastant "
"segur que no fallarà."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:36
msgid "**Using the AS operator**"
msgstr "**Usant l'operador AS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:38
msgid ""
"The ``as`` operator returns ``null`` if the node cannot be cast to Sprite2D, "
"and for that reason, it cannot be used with value types."
msgstr ""
"L'operador ``as`` retorna ``null`` si el node no es pot emetre a Sprite2D i, "
"per aquest motiu, no es pot utilitzar amb tipus de valor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:47
msgid "**Using the generic methods**"
msgstr "**Usant els mètodes genèrics**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:49
msgid ""
"Generic methods are also provided to make this type conversion transparent."
msgstr ""
"També es proporcionen mètodes genèrics per fer transparent aquesta conversió "
"de tipus."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:51
msgid ""
"``GetNode<T>()`` casts the node before returning it. It will throw an "
"``InvalidCastException`` if the node cannot be cast to the desired type."
msgstr ""
"``GetNode<T>()`` llança el node abans de tornar-lo. Llançarà una "
"``InvalidCastException`` si el node no es pot emetre al tipus desitjat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:58
msgid ""
"``GetNodeOrNull<T>()`` uses the ``as`` operator and will return ``null`` if "
"the node cannot be cast to the desired type."
msgstr ""
"``GetNodeOrNull<T>()`` utilitza l'operador ``as`` i retornarà ``null`` si el "
"node no es pot emetre al tipus desitjat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:66
msgid "**Type checking using the IS operator**"
msgstr "**Comprovació de tipus mitjançant l'operador IS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:68
msgid ""
"To check if the node can be cast to Sprite2D, you can use the ``is`` "
"operator. The ``is`` operator returns false if the node cannot be cast to "
"Sprite2D, otherwise it returns true. Note that when the ``is`` operator is "
"used against ``null`` the result is always going to be ``false``."
msgstr ""
"Per comprovar si el node es pot emetre a Sprite2D, podeu utilitzar "
"l'operador ``is``. L'operador ``is`` retorna false si el node no es pot "
"emetre a Sprite2D, en cas contrari retorna true. Tingueu en compte que quan "
"s'utilitza l'operador ``is`` contra ``null``, el resultat sempre serà "
"``fals``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:85
msgid ""
"You can also declare a new variable to conditionally store the result of the "
"cast if the ``is`` operator returns ``true``."
msgstr ""
"També podeu declarar una variable nova per emmagatzemar condicionalment el "
"resultat de la distribució si l'operador ``is`` retorna ``true``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:96
msgid ""
"For more advanced type checking, you can look into `Pattern Matching "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/pattern-matching>`_."
msgstr ""
"Per a una comprovació de tipus més avançada, podeu consultar `Coincidència "
"de patrons <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/pattern-"
"matching>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:100
msgid "Preprocessor defines"
msgstr "El preprocessador defineix"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:102
msgid ""
"Godot has a set of defines that allow you to change your C# code depending "
"on the environment you are compiling to."
msgstr ""
"Godot té un conjunt de definicions que us permeten canviar el vostre codi C# "
"en funció de l'entorn en què esteu compilant."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:108
msgid "For example, you can change code based on the platform:"
msgstr "Per exemple, podeu canviar el codi en funció de la plataforma:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:122
msgid ""
"Or you can detect which engine your code is in, useful for making cross-"
"engine libraries:"
msgstr ""
"O podeu detectar en quin motor es troba el vostre codi, útil per fer "
"biblioteques entre motors:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:137
msgid ""
"Or you can write scripts that target multiple Godot versions and take "
"advantage of features that are only available on some of those versions:"
msgstr ""
"O podeu escriure scripts orientats a diverses versions de Godot i aprofitar "
"les funcions que només estan disponibles en algunes d'aquestes versions:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:152
msgid "Full list of defines"
msgstr "Llista completa de definicions"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:154
msgid "``GODOT`` is always defined for Godot projects."
msgstr "``GODOT`` sempre es defineix per als projectes Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:156
msgid ""
"``TOOLS`` is defined when building with the Debug configuration (editor and "
"editor player)."
msgstr ""
"``TOOLS`` es defineix quan es construeix amb la configuració Debug (editor i "
"reproductor de l'editor)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:158
msgid ""
"``GODOT_REAL_T_IS_DOUBLE`` is defined when the ``GodotFloat64`` property is "
"set to ``true``."
msgstr ""
"``GODOT_REAL_T_IS_DOUBLE`` es defineix quan la propietat ``GodotFloat64`` "
"s'estableix en ``true``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:160
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_OSX``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the OS. These "
"names may change in the future. These are created from the ``get_name()`` "
"method of the :ref:`OS <class_OS>` singleton, but not every possible OS the "
"method returns is an OS that Godot with .NET runs on."
msgstr ""
"Un de ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_OSX``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, ``GODOT_WEB`` segons el sistema operatiu. "
"Aquests noms poden canviar en el futur. Aquests es creen a partir del mètode "
"``get_name()`` del singleton :ref:`OS <class_OS>`, però no tots els SO "
"possibles que retorna el mètode són un sistema operatiu en què s'executa "
"Godot amb .NET."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:167
msgid ""
"``GODOTX``, ``GODOTX_Y``, ``GODOTX_Y_Z``, ``GODOTx_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOTX_y_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOTX_Y_z_OR_GREATER``, where ``X``, ``Y``, "
"and ``Z`` are replaced by the current major, minor and patch version of "
"Godot. ``x``, ``y``, and ``z`` are replaced by all values from 0 to the "
"current version number for that component."
msgstr ""
"``GODOTX``, ``GODOTX_Y``, ``GODOTX_Y_Z``, ``GODOTx_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOTX_y_OR_GREATER`` i ``GODOTX_Y_z_OR_GREATER``, on ``X````, els "
"principals substitueixen per ``X```, ```` Y````, `````'''''''', "
"''d'''''''''' i versió de pedaç de Godot. ``x``, ``y`` i ``z`` es "
"substitueixen per tots els valors des de 0 fins al número de versió actual "
"d'aquest component."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:175
msgid ""
"These defines were first added in Godot 4.0.4 and 4.1. Version defines for "
"prior versions do not exist, regardless of the current Godot version."
msgstr ""
"Aquestes definicions es van afegir per primera vegada a Godot 4.0.4 i 4.1. "
"Les definicions de versions per a versions anteriors no existeixen, "
"independentment de la versió actual de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:178
msgid ""
"For example: Godot 4.0.5 defines ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_0``, ``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_0_5``, "
"``GODOT4_0_4_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOT4_0_5_OR_GREATER``. Godot 4.3.2 "
"defines ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3``, "
"``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_1_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_2_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3_2``, ``GODOT4_3_0_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_1_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOT4_3_2_OR_GREATER``."
msgstr ""
"Per exemple: Godot 4.0.5 defineix ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_0``, ``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_0_5``, ``GODOT4_0_4_OR` i_ "
"``GODOT4_0_5_OR_GREATER``. Godot 4.3.2 defineix ``GODOT4``, "
"``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3``, ``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_1_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_2_OR_GREATER`` ``GODOT4_3_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_2``, ``GODOT4_3_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3_1_OR_GREATER`` i "
"``GODOT4_3_2_OR_GREATER``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:186
msgid ""
"When **exporting**, the following may also be defined depending on the "
"export features:"
msgstr ""
"Quan s'exporta**, també es pot definir el següent en funció de les funcions "
"d'exportació:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:188
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_PC``, ``GODOT_MOBILE``, or ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the "
"platform type."
msgstr ""
"Un de ``GODOT_PC``, ``GODOT_MOBILE`` o ``GODOT_WEB`` segons el tipus de "
"plataforma."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:190
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_MACOS``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, or ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the platform."
msgstr ""
"Un de ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_MACOS``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS`` o ``GODOT_WEB`` segons la plataforma."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:192
msgid ""
"To see an example project, see the OS testing demo: https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/os_test"
msgstr ""
"Per veure un projecte d'exemple, consulteu la demo de proves del sistema "
