#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:274
msgid ""
"``preload``, as it works in GDScript, is not available in C#. Use "
"``GD.Load`` or ``ResourceLoader.Load`` instead."
msgstr ""
"``preload``, ja que funciona a GDScript, no està disponible en C#. Utilitzeu "
"``GD.Load`` o ``ResourceLoader.Load``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:278
msgid "``@export`` annotation"
msgstr "Anotació ``@export``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:280
msgid ""
"Use the ``[Export]`` attribute instead of the GDScript ``@export`` "
"annotation. This attribute can also be provided with "
"optional :ref:`PropertyHint<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>` and "
"``hintString`` parameters. Default values can be set by assigning a value."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu l'atribut ``[Export]`` en comptes de l'anotació ``@export`` de "
"GDScript. Aquest atribut també es pot proporcionar amb paràmetres "
"opcionals :ref:`PropertyHint<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>` i "
"``hintString``. Els valors per defecte es poden establir assignant un valor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:305
msgid "See also: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports`."
msgstr "Vegeu també: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:308
msgid "``signal`` keyword"
msgstr "paraula clau ``senyal``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:310
msgid ""
"Use the ``[Signal]`` attribute to declare a signal instead of the GDScript "
"``signal`` keyword. This attribute should be used on a `delegate`, whose "
"name signature will be used to define the signal. The `delegate` must have "
"the ``EventHandler`` suffix, an `event` will be generated in the class with "
"the same name but without the suffix, use that event's name with "
"``EmitSignal``."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu l'atribut ``[Signal]`` per declarar un senyal en lloc de la "
"paraula clau ``signal`` de GDScript. Aquest atribut s'ha d'utilitzar en un "
"\"delegat\", la signatura del nom s'utilitzarà per definir el senyal. El "
"`delegat` ha de tenir el sufix ``EventHandler``, es generarà un "
"`esdeveniment` a la classe amb el mateix nom però sense el sufix, utilitzeu "
"el nom d'aquest esdeveniment amb ``EmitSignal``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:319
msgid "See also: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_signals`."
msgstr "Vegeu també: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_signals`."

