#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:92
msgid ""
"Other C# arrays are not supported by the Godot C# API since a packed array "
"equivalent does not exist. See the list "
"of :ref:`c_sharp_variant_compatible_types`."
msgstr ""
"Altres matrius C# no són compatibles amb l'API de Godot C#, ja que no "
"existeix cap equivalent de matriu empaquetada. Vegeu la llista "
"de :ref:`c_sharp_variant_compatible_types`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:100
msgid ""
"Godot arrays are implemented as an array of ``Variant`` and can contain "
"several elements of any type. In C#, the equivalent type is "
"``Godot.Collections.Array``."
msgstr ""
"Les matrius Godot s'implementen com una matriu de ``Variant`` i poden "
"contenir diversos elements de qualsevol tipus. En C#, el tipus equivalent és "
"``Godot.Collections.Array``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:103
msgid ""
"The generic ``Godot.Collections.Array<T>`` type allows restricting the "
"element type to a :ref:`Variant-compatible type "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."
msgstr ""
"El tipus genèric ``Godot.Collections.Array<T>`` permet restringir el tipus "
"d'element a un :ref:`Tipus compatible amb variants "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:106
msgid ""
"An untyped ``Godot.Collections.Array`` can be converted to a typed array "
"using the ``Godot.Collections.Array<T>(Godot.Collections.Array)`` "
"constructor."
msgstr ""
"Un ``Godot.Collections.Array`` sense escriure es pot convertir en una matriu "
"escrit utilitzant el constructor "
"``Godot.Collections.Array<T>(Godot.Collections.Array)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:111
msgid ""
"Despite the name, Godot arrays are more similar to the C# collection "
"``List<T>`` than ``System.Array``. Their size is not fixed and can grow or "
"shrink as elements are added/removed from the collection."
msgstr ""
"Malgrat el nom, les matrius Godot són més semblants a la col·lecció C# "
"``List<T>`` que a ``System.Array``. La seva mida no és fixa i pot créixer o "
"reduir-se a mesura que s'afegeixen/eliminen elements de la col·lecció."

