#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:194
msgid ""
"Godot dictionaries are implemented as a dictionary with ``Variant`` keys and "
"values. In C#, the equivalent type is ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary``."
msgstr ""
"Els diccionaris Godot s'implementen com un diccionari amb claus i valors "
"``Variant``. En C#, el tipus equivalent és ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:197
msgid ""
"The generic ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>`` type allows "
"restricting the key and value types to a :ref:`Variant-compatible type "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."
msgstr ""
"El tipus genèric ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>`` permet "
"restringir els tipus de clau i valor a un :ref:`Tipus compatible amb "
"variants <c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:200
msgid ""
"An untyped ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary`` can be converted to a typed "
"dictionary using the ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, "
"TValue>(Godot.Collections.Dictionary)`` constructor."
msgstr ""
"Un ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary`` sense escriure es pot convertir en un "
"diccionari escrit mitjançant el constructor "
"``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>(Godot.Collections.Dictionary)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:205
msgid ""
"If you need a dictionary where the key is typed but not the value, use "
"``Variant`` as the ``TValue`` generic parameter of the typed dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Si necessiteu un diccionari on s'escriu la clau però no el valor, utilitzeu "
"``Variant`` com a paràmetre genèric ``TValue`` del diccionari escrit."

