#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:658
msgid "Every second, we output our position to the console."
msgstr "Cada segon, enviem la nostra posició a la consola."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:663
msgid ""
"We hope the above example showed you the basics. You can build upon this "
