#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:4
msgid "Core functions and types"
msgstr "Funcions i tipus bàsics"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:6
msgid ""
"godot-cpp's API is designed to be as similar as possible to Godot's internal "
"API."
msgstr ""
"L'API de godot-cpp està dissenyada per ser el més semblant possible a l'API "
"interna de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:8
msgid ""
"This means that, in general, you can use the :ref:`Engine details "
"<doc_engine_architecture>` section to learn how to work with godot-cpp. In "
"addition, it can often be useful to browse the `engine's code <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot>`__ for examples for how to work with Godot's "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Això vol dir que, en general, podeu utilitzar la secció :ref:`Detalls del "
"motor <doc_engine_architecture>` per aprendre a treballar amb godot-cpp. A "
"més, sovint pot ser útil navegar pel codi del `motor <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot>`__ per obtenir exemples de com treballar amb l'API de "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:12
msgid ""
"That being said, there are some differences to be aware of, which are "
"documented here."
msgstr ""
"Dit això, hi ha algunes diferències que cal tenir en compte, que es "
"documenten aquí."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:15
msgid "Common functions and macros"
msgstr "Funcions i macros comunes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:17
msgid ""
"Please refer to :ref:`doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros` for information "
"on this. The functions and macros documented there are also available in "
"godot-cpp."
msgstr ""
"Consulteu :ref:`doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros` per obtenir informació "
"sobre això. Les funcions i macros documentades també estan disponibles a "
"godot-cpp."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:21
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/core_types.rst:4
msgid "Core types"
msgstr "Tipus de nucli"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:23
msgid ""
"Godot's :ref:`Core types <doc_core_types>` are also available in godot-cpp, "
"and the same recommendations apply as described in that article. The types "
"are regularly synchronized with the Godot codebase."
msgstr ""
"Els :ref:`Els tipus bàsics <doc_core_types>` de Godot també estan "
"disponibles a godot-cpp, i s'apliquen les mateixes recomanacions que es "
"descriuen en aquest article. Els tipus es sincronitzen regularment amb la "
"base de codi Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:26
msgid ""
"In your own code, you can also use `C++ STL types <https://"
"en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container.html>`__, or types from any library you "
"choose, but they won't be compatible with Godot's APIs."
msgstr ""
"Al vostre propi codi, també podeu utilitzar `Tipus STL C++ <https://"
"en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container.html>`__, o tipus de qualsevol "
"biblioteca que trieu, però no seran compatibles amb les API de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:32
msgid ""
"While in Godot, the ``Packed*Array`` types are aliases of ``Vector``, in "
"godot-cpp, they're their own types, using the Godot bindings. This is "
"because ``Packed*Array`` are exposed to Godot and limited to only Godot "
"types, whereas ``Vector`` can hold any C++ type which Godot might not be "
"able to understand."
msgstr ""
"Mentre que a Godot, els tipus ``Packed*Array`` són àlies de ``Vector``, a "
"godot-cpp, són els seus propis tipus, utilitzant els enllaços Godot. Això es "
"deu al fet que ``Packed*Array`` estan exposats a Godot i es limiten només "
"als tipus Godot, mentre que ``Vector`` pot contenir qualsevol tipus de C++ "
"que Godot no pugui entendre."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:36
msgid ""
"In general, the ``Packed*Array`` types work the same way as their ``Vector`` "
"aliases, however, there are some notable differences."
msgstr ""
"En general, els tipus ``Packed*Array`` funcionen de la mateixa manera que "
"els seus àlies ``Vector``, però, hi ha algunes diferències notables."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:40
msgid "Data access"
msgstr "Retrocés"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:42
msgid ""
"``Vector`` keeps its data entirely within the GDExtension, whereas the "
"``Packed*Array`` types keep their data on the Godot side. This means that "
"any time a ``Packed*Array`` is accessed, it needs to call into Godot."
msgstr ""
"``Vector`` manté les seves dades completament dins de l'extensió GDE, mentre "
"que els tipus ``Packed*Array`` mantenen les seves dades al costat de Godot. "
"Això vol dir que cada vegada que s'accedeix a un ``Packed*Array``, ha de "
"trucar a Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:45
msgid ""
"To efficiently read or write a large amount of data into a ``Packed*Array``, "
"you should call ``.ptr()`` (for reading) or ``.ptrw()`` (for writing) to get "
"a pointer directly to the array's memory:"
msgstr ""
"Per llegir o escriure de manera eficient una gran quantitat de dades en un "
"``Packed*Array``, hauríeu de cridar ``.ptr()`` (per llegir) o ``.ptrw()`` "
"(per escriure) per obtenir un punter directament a la memòria de la matriu:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:72
msgid "Copying"
msgstr "Copia"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:74
msgid ""
"``Variant`` wrappers for ``Packed*Array`` treat them as pass-by-reference, "
"while the ``Packed*Array`` types themselves are pass-by-value (implemented "
"as copy-on-write)."
msgstr ""
"Els embolcalls ``Variant`` per a ``Packed*Array`` els tracten com a "
"referència de pas per referència, mentre que els mateixos tipus "
"``Packed*Array`` són de valor de pas (implementat com a còpia sobre "
"escriptura)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:77
msgid ""
"In addition, it may be of interest that GDScript calls use the ``Variant`` "
"call interface: Any ``Packed*Array`` arguments to your functions will be "
"passed in a ``Variant``, and unpacked from there. This can create copies of "
"the types, so the argument you receive may be a copy of the argument that "
"the function was called with. In practice, this means you cannot rely on "
"that the argument passed to you can be modified at the caller's site."
msgstr ""
"A més, pot ser interessant que les trucades de GDScript utilitzin la "
"interfície de trucada ``Variant``: qualsevol argument ``Packed*Array`` a les "
"vostres funcions es passarà en una ``Variant`` i descomprimirà des d'allà. "
"Això pot crear còpies dels tipus, de manera que l'argument que rebeu pot ser "
"una còpia de l'argument amb el qual es va cridar la funció. A la pràctica, "
"això significa que no podeu confiar en que l'argument que us va passar es "
"pot modificar al lloc de la persona que truca."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:83
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/variant_class.rst:4
msgid "Variant class"
msgstr "Classe variant"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:85
msgid ""
"Please refer to :ref:`doc_variant_class` to learn about how to work with "
"``Variant``."
msgstr ""
"Consulteu :ref:`doc_variant_class` per obtenir informació sobre com "
"treballar amb ``Variant``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:87
msgid ""
"Most importantly, you should be aware that all functions exposed through the "
"GDExtension API must be compatible with ``Variant``."
msgstr ""
"El més important és que tingueu en compte que totes les funcions exposades a "
"través de l'API GDExtension han de ser compatibles amb ``Variant``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:91
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:4
msgid "Object class"
msgstr "Classe d'objectes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:93
msgid ""
"Please refer to :ref:`doc_object_class` to learn how to register and work "
"with your own ``Object`` types."
msgstr ""
"Consulteu :ref:`doc_object_class` per saber com registrar-vos i treballar "
"amb els vostres propis tipus d'objectes."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:95
msgid ""
"We are not aware of any major differences between the godot-cpp ``Object`` "
"API and Godot's internal ``Object`` API, except that some methods are "
"available in Godot's internal API that are not available in godot-cpp."
msgstr ""
"No som conscients de cap diferència important entre l'API ``Object`` godot-"
"cpp i l'API ``Object`` interna de Godot, excepte que alguns mètodes estan "
"disponibles a l'API interna de Godot que no estan disponibles a godot-cpp."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:98
msgid ""
"You should be aware that the pointer to your godot-cpp ``Object`` is "
"different from the pointer that Godot uses internally. This is because the "
"godot-cpp version is an extension instance, allocated separately from the "
"original ``Object``. However, in practice, this difference is usually not "
"noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Heu de tenir en compte que el punter al vostre ``Objecte`` godot-cpp és "
"diferent del punter que Godot utilitza internament. Això es deu al fet que "
"la versió godot-cpp és una instància d'extensió, assignada per separat de "
"l'original ``Object``. No obstant això, a la pràctica, aquesta diferència "
"normalment no es nota."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:4
msgid "Adding documentation"
msgstr "Organització de la documentació"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:8
msgid ""
"Adding documentation for GDExtensions is only possible with Godot 4.3 and "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Afegir documentació per a GDExtensions només és possible amb Godot 4.3 i "
"posteriors."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:10
msgid ""
"The GDExtension documentation system works in a similar manner to the built-"
"in engine documentation: It uses :ref:`XML files "
"<doc_class_reference_primer>` (one per class) to document the exposed "
"constructors, properties, methods, constants, signals, and more."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de documentació GDExtension funciona de manera similar a la "
"documentació del motor integrat: utilitza :ref:`fitxers XML "
"<doc_class_reference_primer>` (un per classe) per documentar els "
"constructors exposats, propietats, mètodes, constants, senyals i més."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:14
msgid ""
"To get started, identify your project's test project folder, which should "
"contain a Godot project with your extension installed and working. If you "
"are using `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-"
"template>`__, your GDExtension project already has a ``project`` folder. "
"Alternatively, you can add one by following the steps described "
"in :ref:`doc_godot_cpp_getting_started`. Inside the ``project`` folder, run "
"the following terminal command:"
msgstr ""
"Per començar, identifiqueu la carpeta del projecte de prova del vostre "
"projecte, que hauria de contenir un projecte Godot amb la vostra extensió "
"instal·lada i funcionant. Si utilitzeu `godot-cpp-template <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__, el vostre projecte "
"GDExtension ja té una carpeta ``project``. Alternativament, podeu afegir-ne "
"un seguint els passos descrits a :ref:`doc_godot_cpp_getting_started`. Dins "
"de la carpeta ``projecte``, executeu la següent comanda de terminal:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:26
msgid ""
"This command instructs Godot to generate documentation via the ``--doctool`` "
"and ``--gdextension-docs`` commands. The ``../`` argument specifies the base "
"path of your GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta ordre indica a Godot que generi documentació mitjançant les ordres "
"``--doctool`` i ``--gdextension-docs``. L'argument ``../`` especifica la "
"ruta base de la vostra GDExtension."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:29
msgid ""
"After running this command, you should find XML files for your registered "
"GDExtension classes inside the ``doc_classes`` folder in your GDExtension "
"project. You could edit them now, but for this tutorial, the empty files "
"will suffice."
msgstr ""
"Després d'executar aquesta ordre, hauríeu de trobar fitxers XML per a les "
"vostres classes GDExtension registrades a la carpeta ``doc_classes`` del "
"vostre projecte GDExtension. Podeu editar-los ara, però per a aquest "
"tutorial n'hi haurà prou amb els fitxers buits."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:32
msgid ""
"Now that you have XML files containing your documentation, the next step is "
"to include them in your GDExtension binary. Assuming you are using SCons as "
"your build system, you can add the following lines to your ``SConstruct`` "
"file. If you are using `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-cpp-template>`__, your file already contains code for this."
msgstr ""
"Ara que teniu fitxers XML que contenen la vostra documentació, el següent "
"pas és incloure'ls al vostre binari GDExtension. Suposant que utilitzeu "
"SCons com a sistema de compilació, podeu afegir les línies següents al "
"fitxer ``SConstruct``. Si utilitzeu `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__, el vostre fitxer ja conté codi per a "
"això."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:43
msgid ""
"The ``if`` statement avoids adding the documentation to release builds of "
"your GDExtension, where it is not needed. SCons then loads all the XML files "
"inside the ``doc_classes`` directory, and appends the resulting targets to "
"the ``sources`` array, to be included in your GDExtension build."
msgstr ""
"La declaració ``if`` evita afegir la documentació per alliberar compilacions "
"de la vostra GDExtension, on no és necessària. A continuació, SCons carrega "
"tots els fitxers XML dins del directori ``doc_classes`` i afegeix els "
"objectius resultants a la matriu ``sources``, per incloure'ls a la vostra "
"compilació GDExtension."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:47
msgid ""
"After building, launch your Godot project again. You can open the "
"documentation of one of your extension classes either using :kbd:`Ctrl + "
"Click` on a class name in the script editor, or inside by finding it in the "
"Editor help dialog. If everything went well, you should see something like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Després de construir, torneu a iniciar el vostre projecte Godot. Podeu obrir "
"la documentació d'una de les vostres classes d'extensió "
"utilitzant :kbd:`Ctrl + Clic` al nom d'una classe a l'editor de scripts, o "
"bé a l'interior, cercant-lo al diàleg d'ajuda de l'editor. Si tot ha anat "
"bé, hauríeu de veure alguna cosa com això:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:54
msgid "Writing and styling documentation"
msgstr "Organització de la documentació"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:56
msgid ""
"The format of the class reference XML files is the same as the one used by "
"Godot. It is documented in :ref:`doc_class_reference_primer`."
msgstr ""
"El format dels fitxers XML de referència de classe és el mateix que el que "
"fa servir Godot. Està documentat a :ref:`doc_class_reference_primer`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:59
msgid ""
"If you are looking for pointers to write high quality documentation, feel "
"free to refer to Godot's `documentation guidelines <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/guidelines/"
"index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"Si busqueu indicacions per escriure documentació d'alta qualitat, no dubteu "
"a consultar les `directrius de documentació <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/guidelines/"
"index.html>`__ de Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:63
msgid "Publishing documentation online"
msgstr "Organització de la documentació"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:65
msgid ""
"You may want to publish an online reference for your GDExtension, similar to "
"this website. The most important step is to build reStructuredText "
"(``.rst``) files from your XML class reference:"
msgstr ""
"És possible que vulgueu publicar una referència en línia per a la vostra "
"extensió GD, similar a aquest lloc web. El pas més important és crear "
"fitxers reStructuredText (``.rst``) a partir de la referència de classe XML:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:77
msgid ""
"Your ``.rst`` files will now be available in ``docs/classes/``. From here, "
"you can use any documentation builder that supports reStructuredText syntax "
"to create a website from them."
msgstr ""
"Els vostres fitxers ``.rst`` ara estaran disponibles a ``docs/classes/``. "
"Des d'aquí, podeu utilitzar qualsevol creador de documentació que admeti la "
"sintaxi de reStructuredText per crear-ne un lloc web."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:80
msgid ""
"`godot-docs <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs>`_ uses `Sphinx "
"<https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/>`_. You can use the repository as a "
"basis to build your own documentation system. The following guide describes "
"the basic steps, but they are not exhaustive: you will need a bit of "
"personal insight to make it work."
msgstr ""
"`godot-docs <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs>`_ utilitza `Sphinx "
"<https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/>`_. Podeu utilitzar el repositori com "
"a base per crear el vostre propi sistema de documentació. La guia següent "
"descriu els passos bàsics, però no són exhaustius: necessitareu una mica de "
"coneixement personal perquè funcioni."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:85
msgid ""
"Add `godot-docs <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs>`_ as a submodule "
"to your ``docs/`` folder."
msgstr ""
"Afegiu `godot-docs <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs>`_ com a "
"submòdul a la carpeta ``docs/``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:86
msgid ""
"Copy over its ``conf.py``, ``index.rst``, ``.readthedocs.yaml`` files into "
"``/docs/``. You may later decide to copy over and edit more of godot-docs' "
"files, like ``_templates/layout.html``."
msgstr ""
"Copieu els seus fitxers ``conf.py``, ``index.rst``, ``.readthedocs.yaml`` a "
"``/docs/``. Més tard podeu decidir copiar i editar més fitxers de godot-"
"docs, com ara ``_templates/layout.html``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:87
msgid ""
"Modify these files according to your project. This mostly involves adjusting "
"paths to point to the ``godot-docs`` subfolder, as well as strings to "
"reflect it's your project rather than Godot you're building the docs for."
msgstr ""
"Modifiqueu aquests fitxers segons el vostre projecte. Això implica "
"principalment ajustar camins per apuntar a la subcarpeta ``godot-docs``, "
"així com cadenes per reflectir que és el vostre projecte en lloc de Godot "
"per al qual esteu creant els documents."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:88
msgid ""
"Create an account on `readthedocs.org <http://readthedocs.org>`_. Import "
"your project, and modify its base ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file path to ``/"
"docs/.readthedocs.yaml``."
msgstr ""
"Creeu un compte a `readthedocs.org <http://readthedocs.org>`_. Importeu el "
"vostre projecte i modifiqueu el camí del fitxer base ``.readthedocs.yaml`` a "
"``/docs/.readthedocs.yaml``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_docs_system.rst:90
msgid ""
"Once you have completed all these steps, your documentation should be "
"available at ``<repo-name>.readthedocs.io``."
msgstr ""
"Un cop hàgiu completat tots aquests passos, la vostra documentació hauria "
"d'estar disponible a ``<repo-name>.readthedocs.io``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/other_languages.rst:6
