#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:440
msgid "After declaration, you can instantiate and initialize them like:"
msgstr "Després de la declaració, podeu crear-los i inicialitzar-los com:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:452
msgid "Or use struct constructor for same purpose:"
msgstr "O utilitzeu el constructor struct per al mateix propòsit:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:458
msgid ""
"Structs may contain other struct or array, you can also instance them as "
"global constant:"
msgstr ""
"Les estructures poden contenir altres estructures o matrius, també les podeu "
"executar com a constant global:"

