msgid ""
"Clip space far ``z`` value. In the Forward+ or Mobile renderers, it's "
"``0.0``. In the Compatibility renderer, it's ``-1.0``."
msgstr ""
"Retalla l'espai fins al valor ``z``. Als renderitzadors Forward+ o Mobile, "
"és ``0.0``. Al renderitzador de compatibilitat, és ``-1.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:197
msgid "in bool **IS_MULTIVIEW**"
msgstr "en bool **IS_MULTIVIEW**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:197
msgid ""
"``true`` when output is stereoscopic (XR), ``false`` when output is "
