"``zw`` is UV6."
msgstr ""
"Valor personalitzat de la primitiva vèrtex. Quan utilitzeu UV addicionals, "
"``xy`` és UV5 i ``zw`` és UV6."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:339
msgid "in vec4 **CUSTOM2**"
msgstr "a vec4 **CUSTOM2**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:339
msgid ""
"Custom value from vertex primitive. When using extra UVs, ``xy`` is UV7 and "
"``zw`` is UV8."
msgstr ""
"Valor personalitzat de la primitiva vèrtex. Quan utilitzeu UV addicionals, "
"``xy`` és UV7 i ``zw`` és UV8."

