#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:633
msgid ""
"Alpha (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``). If written to on any branch, the material will "
"go through the transparent pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Alfa (interval ``[0.0, 1.0]``). Si s'escriu a qualsevol branca, el material "
"passarà per la canonada transparent."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:644
msgid ""
"Transparent materials also cannot cast shadows or appear in "
"``hint_screen_texture`` and ``hint_depth_texture`` uniforms. This in turn "
"prevents those materials from appearing in screen-space reflections or "
"refraction. :ref:`SDFGI <doc_using_sdfgi>` sharp reflections are not visible "
"on transparent materials (only rough reflections are visible on transparent "
"materials)."
msgstr ""
"Els materials transparents tampoc no poden projectar ombres ni aparèixer als "
"uniformes ``hint_screen_texture`` i ``hint_depth_texture``. Això al seu torn "
"evita que aquests materials apareguin en reflexos o refraccions de l'espai "
"de la pantalla. :ref:`SDFGI <doc_using_sdfgi>` els reflexos nítids no són "
"visibles en materials transparents (només els reflexos rugosos són visibles "
"en materials transparents)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:4
msgid "CanvasItem shaders"
msgstr "Shaders CanvasItem"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:6
msgid ""
"CanvasItem shaders are used to draw all 2D elements in Godot. These include "
"all nodes that inherit from CanvasItems, and all GUI elements."
msgstr ""
"Els shaders CanvasItem s'utilitzen per dibuixar tots els elements 2D a "
"Godot. Aquests inclouen tots els nodes que hereten de CanvasItems i tots els "
"elements de la GUI."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:9
msgid ""
"CanvasItem shaders contain fewer built-in variables and functionality "
"than :ref:`Spatial shaders<doc_spatial_shader>`, but they maintain the same "
"basic structure with vertex, fragment, and light processor functions."
msgstr ""
"Els ombrejats CanvasItem contenen menys variables i funcionalitats "
"integrades que els :ref:`Spacial shaders<doc_spatial_shader>`, però mantenen "
"la mateixa estructura bàsica amb funcions de vèrtex, fragment i processador "
"lleuger."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:27
msgid "Pre-multiplied alpha blend mode."
msgstr "Mode de combinació alfa premultiplicat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:29
msgid "**blend_disabled**"
msgstr "**blend_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:29
msgid "Disable blending, values (including alpha) are written as-is."
msgstr ""
"Desactiveu la combinació, els valors (inclòs l'alfa) s'escriuen tal com "
"estan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:31
msgid "Result is just albedo. No lighting/shading happens in material."
msgstr ""
"El resultat és només albedo. No hi ha il·luminació/ombra en el material."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:33
msgid "**light_only**"
msgstr "**només_llum**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:33
