msgid ""
"Certain nodes (for example, :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>`) display a "
"texture by default, for example :ref:`texture "
"<class_Sprite2D_property_texture>`. When using a custom ``fragment()`` "
"function, you have a few options on how to sample this texture."
msgstr ""
"Alguns nodes (per exemple, :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>`) mostren una "
"textura per defecte, per exemple :ref:`texture "
"<class_Sprite2D_property_texture>`. Quan utilitzeu una funció personalitzada "
"``fragment()``, teniu algunes opcions sobre com provar aquesta textura."

