msgstr "Taronja"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.rst:153
msgid "A texture sampler. It can be used to sample textures."
msgstr "Un mostrador de textures. Es pot utilitzar per mostrar textures."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.rst:154
