#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/using_viewport_as_texture.rst:78
msgid ""
"Now we have the basics of a :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` that we "
"render to and we have a unique image that we can apply to the sphere."
msgstr ""
"Ara tenim els fonaments bàsics d'un :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` "
"al qual renderitzem i tenim una imatge única que podem aplicar a l'esfera."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/using_viewport_as_texture.rst:82
msgid "Applying the texture"
msgstr "Aplicant la textura"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/using_viewport_as_texture.rst:84
msgid ""
"Now go into the :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>` and add "
"a :ref:`StandardMaterial3D <class_StandardMaterial3D>` to it. No need for a "
