msgid ""
"`servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/4.6/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/4.6/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:833
msgid "Automatic mesh LOD"
msgstr "LOD automàtic de malla"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:835
msgid ""
"The ImporterMesh class is used for the 3D mesh import workflow in the "
"editor. Its ``generate_lods()`` function handles generating using the "
"`meshoptimizer <https://meshoptimizer.org/>`__ library."
msgstr ""
"La classe ImporterMesh s'usa per al flux de treball d'importació de malles "
"3D a l'editor. La seva funció ``generate_lods()`` s'encarrega de la "
"generació usant la biblioteca `meshoptimizer <https://meshoptimizer.org/>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:839
msgid ""
"LOD mesh generation also generates shadow meshes at the same time. These are "
"meshes that have their vertices welded regardless of smoothing and "
"materials. This is used to improve shadow rendering performance by lowering "
"the vertex throughput required to render shadows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:844
msgid ""
"The RenderingSceneCull class's ``_render_scene()`` function determines which "
"mesh LOD should be used when rendering. Each viewport can render the same "
"mesh with different LODs (to allow for split screen rendering to look "
"correct)."
msgstr ""
"La funció ``_render_scene()`` de la classe RenderingSceneCull determina quin "
"LOD de malla s'ha d'usar en renderitzar. Cada viewport pot renderitzar la "
"mateixa malla amb LOD diferents (per permetre que el renderitzat en pantalla "
"dividida es vegi correctament)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:848
msgid ""
"The mesh LOD is automatically chosen based on a screen coverage metric. This "
"takes resolution and camera FOV changes into account without requiring user "
"intervention. The threshold multiplier can be adjusted in the project "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"El LOD de la malla es tria automàticament segons una mètrica de cobertura en "
"pantalla. Això té en compte els canvis de resolució i de FOV de la càmera "
"sense requerir intervenció de l'usuari. El multiplicador de llindar es pot "
"ajustar als paràmetres del projecte."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:852
msgid ""
"To improve performance, shadow rendering and reflection probe rendering also "
"choose their own mesh LOD thresholds (which can be different from the main "
"scene rendering)."
msgstr ""
"Per millorar el rendiment, el renderitzat d'ombres i el renderitzat de "
"sondes de reflexió també trien els seus propis llindars de LOD de malla (que "
"poden ser diferents dels del renderitzat principal de l'escena)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:855
msgid "**Mesh LOD generation on import C++ code:**"
msgstr "**Codi C++ de generació de LOD de malla en importar:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:857
msgid ""
"`scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/4.6/scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/4.6/scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp>`__"

