"Consulteu :ref:`doc_binding_to_external_libraries` per als detalls sobre "
"l'enllaç amb biblioteques externes."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:260
msgid ""
"If your module is meant to be accessed from the running project (not just "
