#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:590
msgid "Use ``GDCLASS`` macro for inheritance, so Godot can wrap it."
msgstr ""
"Useu la macro ``GDCLASS`` per a l'herència, perquè Godot la pugui "
"embolcallar."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:591
msgid ""
"Use ``_bind_methods`` to bind your functions to scripting, and to allow them "
"to work as callbacks for signals."
msgstr ""
"Useu ``_bind_methods`` per vincular les vostres funcions als scripts i "
"permetre que funcionin com a callbacks de senyals."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:593
msgid ""
"**Avoid multiple inheritance for classes exposed to Godot**, as ``GDCLASS`` "
"doesn't support this. You can still use multiple inheritance in your own "
"classes as long as they're not exposed to Godot's scripting API."
msgstr ""
"**Eviteu l'herència múltiple per a classes exposades a Godot**, ja que "
"``GDCLASS`` no ho admet. Encara podeu usar herència múltiple a les vostres "
"pròpies classes sempre que no estiguin exposades a l'API de scripting de "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:597
msgid ""
"But this is not all, depending what you do, you will be greeted with some "
"(hopefully positive) surprises."
msgstr ""
"Però això no és tot; segons el que feu, us trobareu amb algunes sorpreses "
"(esperem que positives)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:600
msgid ""
"If you inherit from :ref:`class_Node` (or any derived node type, such as "
"Sprite2D), your new class will appear in the editor, in the inheritance tree "
"in the \"Add Node\" dialog."
msgstr ""
"Si hereteu de :ref:`class_Node` (o de qualsevol tipus de node derivat, com "
"Sprite2D), la vostra classe nova apareixerà a l'editor, a l'arbre d'herència "
"del diàleg \"Add Node\"."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:603
msgid ""
"If you inherit from :ref:`class_Resource`, it will appear in the resource "
"list, and all the exposed properties can be serialized when saved/loaded."
msgstr ""
"Si hereteu de :ref:`class_Resource`, apareixerà a la llista de recursos, i "
"totes les propietats exposades es podran serialitzar en desar i carregar."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:606
msgid ""
"By this same logic, you can extend the Editor and almost any area of the "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"Seguint aquesta mateixa lògica, podeu estendre l'Editor i gairebé qualsevol "
"àrea del motor."

