#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/index.rst:6
msgid "The GDExtension system"
msgstr "El sistema GDExtension"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/index.rst:8
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:6
msgid ""
"**GDExtension** is a Godot-specific technology that lets the engine interact "
"with native `shared libraries <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Shared_library>`__ at runtime. You can use it to run native code without "
"compiling it with the engine."
msgstr ""
"**GDExtension** és una tecnologia específica de Godot que permet que el "
"motor interactuï amb `biblioteques compartides <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Shared_library>`__ natives en temps d'execució. La podeu usar per "
"executar codi natiu sense compilar-lo amb el motor."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"GDExtension is *not* a scripting language and has no relation "
"to :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>`."
msgstr ""
"GDExtension *no* és un llenguatge de scripting i no té cap relació "
"amb :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"This section describes how GDExtension works, and is generally aimed at "
"people wanting to make a GDExtension from scratch, for example to create "
"language bindings. If you want to use existing language bindings, please "
"refer to other articles instead, such as the articles about :ref:`C++ (godot-"
"cpp) <doc_godot_cpp>` or one of the :ref:`community-made ones "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta secció descriu com funciona GDExtension, i s'adreça generalment a "
"les persones que volen crear una GDExtension des de zero, per exemple per "
"crear bindings de llenguatge. Si voleu usar bindings de llenguatge "
"existents, consulteu altres articles, com els articles sobre :ref:`C++ "
"(godot-cpp) <doc_godot_cpp>` o algun dels :ref:`creats per la comunitat "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:4
msgid "What is GDExtension?"
msgstr "Què és GDExtension?"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:10
msgid "There are three primary methods with which this is achieved:"
msgstr "Hi ha tres mètodes principals amb què s'aconsegueix això:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:12
msgid ""
"``gdextension_interface.h``: A set of C functions that Godot and a "
"GDExtension can use to communicate."
msgstr ""
"``gdextension_interface.h``: un conjunt de funcions C que Godot i una "
"GDExtension poden usar per comunicar-se."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:13
msgid ""
"``extension_api.json``: A list of C functions that are exposed from Godot "
"APIs (:ref:`Core Features <doc_scripting_core_features>`)."
msgstr ""
"``extension_api.json``: una llista de funcions C exposades des de les API de "
"Godot (:ref:`funcions del nucli <doc_scripting_core_features>`)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`*.gdextension <doc_gdextension_file>`: A file format read by Godot to "
"load a GDExtension."
msgstr ""
":ref:`*.gdextension <doc_gdextension_file>`: un format de fitxer que Godot "
"llegeix per carregar una GDExtension."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:16
msgid ""
"Most people create GDExtensions with some existing language binding, such "
"as :ref:`godot-cpp (for C++) <doc_godot_cpp>`, or one of the :ref:`community-"
"made ones <doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."
msgstr ""
"La majoria de gent crea GDExtensions amb algun binding de llenguatge "
"existent, com :ref:`godot-cpp (per a C++) <doc_godot_cpp>`, o algun "
"dels :ref:`bindings creats per la comunitat "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:22
msgid ""
"See :ref:`godot-cpp Version Compatibility "
"<doc_what_is_gdextension_version_compatibility>`, which applies to all "
"GDExtensions."
msgstr ""
"Vegeu :ref:`compatibilitat de versions de godot-cpp "
"<doc_what_is_gdextension_version_compatibility>`, que s'aplica a totes les "
"GDExtensions."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:4
msgid "The .gdextension file"
msgstr "El fitxer .gdextension"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``.gdextension`` file in your project contains the instructions for how "
"to load the GDExtension. The instructions are separated into specific "
"sections. This page should give you a quick overview of the different "
"options available to you. For an introduction how to get started with C++ "
"(godot-cpp), take a look at the :ref:`GDExtension C++ Example "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`."
msgstr ""
"El fitxer ``.gdextension`` del vostre projecte conté les instruccions sobre "
"com carregar la GDExtension. Les instruccions estan separades en seccions "
"específiques. Aquesta pàgina us hauria de donar una visió general ràpida de "
"les diferents opcions disponibles. Per a una introducció sobre com començar "
"amb C++ (godot-cpp), consulteu l':ref:`exemple de GDExtension en C++ "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:15
msgid "Configuration section"
msgstr "Animació"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:18
msgid "Property"
msgstr "Propietat"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:20
msgid "**entry_symbol**"
msgstr "**entry_symbol**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:20
msgid ""
"Name of the entry function for initializing the GDExtension. This function "
"should be defined in the ``register_types.cpp`` file when using godot-cpp. "
"Adding this is necessary for the extension to work."
msgstr ""
"Nom de la funció d'entrada per inicialitzar la GDExtension. Aquesta funció "
"s'hauria de definir al fitxer ``register_types.cpp`` quan s'usa godot-cpp. "
"Afegir-la és necessari perquè l'extensió funcioni."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:24
msgid "**compatibility_minimum**"
msgstr "**compatibility_minimum**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:24
msgid ""
"Minimum compatible version. This prevents older versions of Godot from "
"loading extensions that depend on features from newer versions of Godot. "
"**Only supported in Godot 4.1 or later**"
msgstr ""
"Versió mínima compatible. Això impedeix que versions antigues de Godot "
"carreguin extensions que depenen de funcions de versions més noves de Godot. "
"**Només és compatible amb Godot 4.1 o posterior**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:27
msgid "**compatibility_maximum**"
msgstr "**compatibility_maximum**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:27
msgid ""
"Maximum compatible version. This prevents newer versions of Godot from "
"loading the extension. **Only supported in Godot 4.3 or later**"
msgstr ""
"Versió màxima compatible. Això impedeix que versions més noves de Godot "
"carreguin l'extensió. **Només és compatible amb Godot 4.3 o posterior**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:30
msgid "**reloadable**"
msgstr "**reloadable**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:30
msgid ""
"Reloads the extension upon recompilation. Reloading is supported for the "
"godot-cpp binding in Godot 4.2 or later. Other language bindings may or may "
"not support it as well. This flag should be mainly used for developing or "
"debugging an extension."
msgstr ""
"Recarrega l'extensió en recompilar-la. La recàrrega és compatible amb el "
"binding godot-cpp a Godot 4.2 o posterior. Altres bindings de llenguatge "
"poden admetre-la o no. Aquesta marca s'hauria d'usar principalment per "
"desenvolupar o depurar una extensió."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:34
msgid "**android_aar_plugin**"
msgstr "**android_aar_plugin**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:34
msgid ""
"The GDExtension is part of a :ref:`v2 Android plugin <doc_android_plugin>`. "
"During export this flag will indicate to the editor that the GDExtension "
"native shared libraries are exported by the Android plugin AAR binaries."
msgstr ""
"La GDExtension forma part d'un :ref:`connector d'Android v2 "
"<doc_android_plugin>`. Durant l'exportació, aquesta marca indicarà a "
"l'editor que les biblioteques compartides natives de la GDExtension "
"s'exporten amb els binaris AAR del connector d'Android."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:40
msgid "Libraries section"
msgstr "Secció de biblioteques"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:42
msgid ""
"In this section you can set the paths to the compiled binaries of your "
"GDExtension libraries. By specifying feature flags you can filter which "
"version should be loaded and exported with your game depending on which "
"feature flags are active. Every feature flag must match to Godot's feature "
"flags or your custom export flags to be loaded in an exported game. For "
"instance ``macos.debug`` means that it will be loaded if Godot has both the "
"``macos`` and ``debug`` flag active. Each line of the section is evaluated "
"from top to bottom."
msgstr ""
"En aquesta secció podeu establir els camins als binaris compilats de les "
"biblioteques de la vostra GDExtension. Especificant marques de funció podeu "
"filtrar quina versió s'ha de carregar i exportar amb el vostre joc segons "
"quines marques de funció estiguin actives. Cada marca de funció ha de "
"coincidir amb les marques de funció de Godot o amb les vostres marques "
"d'exportació personalitzades perquè es carregui en un joc exportat. Per "
"exemple, ``macos.debug`` vol dir que es carregarà si Godot té actives tant "
"la marca ``macos`` com ``debug``. Cada línia de la secció s'avalua de dalt a "
"baix."

