#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:277
msgid ""
"As we don't have anything to do with those functions yet, they'll stay empty "
"for a while."
msgstr ""
"Com que encara no tenim res a veure amb aquestes funcions, es quedaran "
"buides durant una estona."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:280
