#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:4
msgid "Custom Godot servers"
msgstr "Servidors personalitzats de Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:9
msgid ""
"Godot implements multi-threading as servers. Servers are daemons which "
"manage data, process it, and push the result. Servers implement the mediator "
"pattern which interprets resource ID and process data for the engine and "
"other modules. In addition, the server claims ownership for its RID "
"allocations."
msgstr ""
"Godot implementa el multifil com a servidors. Els servidors són dimonis que "
"gestionen dades, les processen i n'envien el resultat. Els servidors "
"implementen el patró mediador, que interpreta ID de recursos i processa "
"dades per al motor i altres mòduls. A més, el servidor reclama la propietat "
"de les seves assignacions de RID."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:15
