"This guide assumes the reader knows how to create C++ modules. If not, refer "
"to this guide :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta guia assumeix que el lector sap com crear mòduls de C++. Si no, "
"consulta aquesta guia :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`."

