msgstr ""
"A la finestra **New from template**, des de **Projects**, selecciona **Empty "
"project** i fes clic a **Go**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:23
msgid "Click Next, to pass the welcome to the new empty project wizard."
msgstr ""
"Fes clic a Next per passar la benvinguda de l'auxiliar de nou projecte buit."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:29
msgid ""
"The project file should be created in the root of the cloned project folder. "
"To achieve this, first, ensure that the **Project title** is the same as the "
"folder name that Godot was cloned into. Unless you cloned the project into a "
"folder with a different name, this will be ``godot``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:31
msgid ""
"Second, ensure that the **Folder to create project in** is the folder you "
"ran the Git clone command from, not the ``godot`` project folder. Confirm "
"that the **Resulting filename** field will create the project file in the "
"root of the cloned project folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:37
msgid ""
"The compiler and configuration settings are managed through **SCons** and "
"will be configured later. However, it's worth deselecting the **Create "
"\"Release\" configuration** option; so only a single build target is created "
"before clicking **Finish**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:44
msgid "Configuring the build"
msgstr "Configurar la compilació"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:46
msgid ""
"The first step is to change the project properties. Right-click on the new "
"project and select **Properties...**."
msgstr ""
"El primer pas és canviar les propietats del projecte. Fes clic dret al nou "
"projecte i selecciona **Properties...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:52
msgid ""
"Check the **This is a custom Makefile** property. Click OK to save the "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Marca la propietat **This is a custom Makefile**. Fes clic a OK per desar "
"els canvis."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:58
msgid ""
"The next step is to change the build options. Right-click on the new project "
"and select **Build Options...**."
msgstr ""
"El pas següent és canviar les opcions de compilació. Fes clic dret al nou "
"projecte i selecciona **Build Options...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the **\"Make\" commands** tab and remove all the existing commands "
"for all the build targets. For each build target enter the **SCons** command "
"for creating the desired build in the **Build project/target** field. The "
"minimum is ``scons``. For details on the **SCons** build options, "
"see :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`. It's also useful to add the "
"``scons --clean`` command in the **Clean project/target** field to the "
"project's default commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:66
msgid ""
"If you're using Windows, all the commands need to be preceded with ``cmd /"
"c`` to initialize the command interpreter."
msgstr ""
"Si utilitzes Windows, totes les ordres han d'anar precedides de ``cmd /c`` "
"per inicialitzar l'intèrpret d'ordres."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:76
msgid "Windows example:"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:82
msgid ""
"Code::Blocks should now be configured to build Godot; so either select "
"**Build > Build**, click the gear button, or press :kbd:`Ctrl + F9`."
msgstr ""
"Code::Blocks ara hauria d'estar configurat per compilar el Godot; així que "
"selecciona **Build > Build**, fes clic al botó de l'engranatge, o "
"prem :kbd:`Ctrl + F9`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:85
msgid "Configuring the run"
msgstr "Configurar l'execució"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:87
msgid ""
"Once **SCons** has successfully built the desired target, reopen the project "
"**Properties...** and select the **Build targets** tab. In the **Output "
"filename** field, browse to the ``bin`` folder and select the compiled file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:89
msgid ""
"Deselect the **Auto-generate filename prefix** and **Auto-generate filename "
"extension** options."
msgstr ""
"Desselecciona les opcions **Auto-generate filename prefix** i **Auto-"
"generate filename extension**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:95
msgid ""
"Code::Blocks should now be configured to run your compiled Godot executable; "
"so either select **Build > Run**, click the green arrow button, or "
"press :kbd:`Ctrl + F10`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:97
msgid ""
"There are two additional points worth noting. First, if required, the "
"**Execution working dir** field can be used to test specific projects, by "
"setting it to the folder containing the ``project.godot`` file. Second, the "
"**Build targets** tab can be used to add and remove build targets for "
"working with and creating different builds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:100
msgid "Adding files to the project"
msgstr "Addició de fitxers al projecte"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:102
msgid ""
"To add all the Godot code files to the project, right-click on the new "
"project and select **Add files recursively...**."
msgstr ""
"Per afegir tots els fitxers de codi del Godot al projecte, fes clic dret al "
"nou projecte i selecciona **Add files recursively...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:108
msgid ""
"It should automatically select the project folder; so simply click **Open**. "
"By default, all code files are included, so simply click **OK**."
msgstr ""
"Hauria de seleccionar automàticament la carpeta del projecte; així que "
"simplement fes clic a **Open**. Per defecte, tots els fitxers de codi "
"s'inclouen, així que simplement fes clic a **OK**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:115
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:92
msgid "Code style configuration"
msgstr "Configuració de l'estil de codi"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:117
msgid ""
"Before editing any files, remember that all code needs to comply with the "
"`code style guidelines <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/"
"engine/guidelines/code_style.html>`__. One important difference with Godot "
"is the use of tabs for indents. Therefore, the key default editor setting "
"that needs to be changed in Code::Blocks is to enable tabs for indents. This "
"setting can be found by selecting **Settings > Editor**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:123
msgid ""
"Under **General Settings**, on the **Editor Settings** tab, under **Tab "
"Options** check **Use TAB character**."
msgstr ""
"A **General Settings**, a la pestanya **Editor Settings**, a **Tab Options** "
"marca **Use TAB character**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:129
msgid ""
"That's it. You're ready to start contributing to Godot using the "
"Code::Blocks IDE. Remember to save the project file and the **Workspace**. "
"If you run into any issues, ask for help in one of `Godot's community "
"channels <https://godotengine.org/community>`__."
msgstr ""
"Ja està. Ja podeu començar a contribuir al Godot usant l'IDE Code::Blocks. "
"Recordeu desar el fitxer de projecte i el **Workspace**. Si trobeu cap "
"problema, demaneu ajuda en un dels `canals de la comunitat del Godot "
"<https://godotengine.org/community>`__."

